servedAt":"2026-10-08T17:46:00.765Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/a9f2e658c438189b6ca1bc0d9b42bab1a59ba534/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T12:47:00Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T12:47:00Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"message":"chore: release v1.0.0\n\nThe 1.0.0 line leaves the `beta` dist-tag. No source change against\nv1.0.0-beta.1 — only the version in the bundle banner moves — so what\nships under `latest` is the artifact the beta cut has been carrying.\n\nFrom here on the published surface follows semver: breaking it takes a\nmajor bump. Dev dependencies were deliberately left where the beta had\nthem; a toolchain refresh belongs after this release, not inside it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vra8A7Wg2No1G8V9Hv85GF","tree":{"sha":"5e3d7e5ed85e6588137c96d0bfecadd21df43cbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/trees/5e3d7e5ed85e6588137c96d0bfecadd21df43cbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/commits/a9f2e658c438189b6ca1bc0d9b42bab1a59ba534","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/a9f2e658c438189b6ca1bc0d9b42bab1a59ba534","node_id":"C_kwDOGEOuPNoAKGE5ZjJlNjU4YzQzODE4OWI2Y2ExYmMwZDliNDJiYWIxYTU5YmE1MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/8889aeefea52694d89fa106174f5cad5a454764c","sha":"8889aeefea52694d89fa106174f5cad5a454764c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/8889aeefea52694d89fa106174f5cad5a454764c"}],"sha":"a9f2e658c438189b6ca1bc0d9b42bab1a59ba534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/a9f2e658c438189b6ca1bc0d9b42bab1a59ba534"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/8889aeefea52694d89fa106174f5cad5a454764c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:30:09Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:30:09Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"message":"chore: release v1.0.0-beta.1 with eventize 6.2.0\n\nMoves the eventize dev dependency to 6.2.0 and cuts the release for it.\nThe peer range stays ^6.0.0 — nothing in src/ uses the guarded dispatch\nvariants that 6.1.0 and 6.2.0 add, so consumers on any 6.x keep working.\n\nemitStrict() was evaluated as a replacement for the delivery frame and\nrejected. It reports per emit(), while a frame here spans more than one:\nBatchFlush.run() opens a single frame around a loop of emits, one per\ndelayed effect, so a whole flush yields one report and no failing effect\ncosts the effects behind it their notification. The first emitStrict() to\nraise would end that loop, so the frame is needed there whatever\nwriteSignal() does. Three further prices: it isolates every subscriber\nrather than only the effects, dissolving the asymmetry a link callback\ndepends on; the peer range would have to narrow to ^6.2.0 for a semantic\nthe library already has; and its guarded dispatch surcharges every emit()\nin the consumer''s process, eventize use unrelated to signals included —\nmeasured here at about 2% on a 64-listener dispatch, up to 29% in\neventize''s own docs.\n\nThe reasoning is recorded in docs/architecture.md under \"Delivery is\nisolated per subscriber\" and at the delivery frame in collect-errors.ts.\nNo behaviour change and no change to the public surface; what moved in\nsrc/ is a comment.\n\npnpm world green: 747 tests across 67 files, twice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019bdJwTNB5upK84ym6AXqmJ","tree":{"sha":"799cd0807de899d55aca80ee98951dd22dc1f45f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/trees/799cd0807de899d55aca80ee98951dd22dc1f45f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/commits/8889aeefea52694d89fa106174f5cad5a454764c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/8889aeefea52694d89fa106174f5cad5a454764c","node_id":"C_kwDOGEOuPNoAKDg4ODlhZWVmZWE1MjY5NGQ4OWZhMTA2MTc0ZjVjYWQ1YTQ1NDc2NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/62ddd14d00d5081f8d5fa780bce7bede846c1819","sha":"62ddd14d00d5081f8d5fa780bce7bede846c1819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/62ddd14d00d5081f8d5fa780bce7bede846c1819"}],"sha":"8889aeefea52694d89fa106174f5cad5a454764c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/8889aeefea52694d89fa106174f5cad5a454764c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/62ddd14d00d5081f8d5fa780bce7bede846c1819/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:04:17Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:04:17Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"message":"build: pin mise-managed toolchain to node 22 and pnpm 11.21.0\n\nMatches the existing engines.node and packageManager fields in\npackage.json so `mise` activates the right versions automatically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012NVqvJndVVCJKggLDjmfPq","tree":{"sha":"34efac9c3768d3e350c2ce07ce56aeb62ac16f10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/trees/34efac9c3768d3e350c2ce07ce56aeb62ac16f10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/commits/62ddd14d00d5081f8d5fa780bce7bede846c1819","verification":{"payload":"tree 34efac9c3768d3e350c2ce07ce56aeb62ac16f10\nparent 3188b9f6964a06855904eb2dded340a9276079d4\nauthor Wolfger Schramm <wolfger@spearwolf.de> 1787987057 +0200\ncommitter Wolfger Schramm <wolfger@spearwolf.de> 1787987057 +0200\n\nbuild: pin mise-managed toolchain to node 22 and pnpm 11.21.0\n\nMatches the existing engines.node and packageManager fields in\npackage.json so `mise` activates the right versions automatically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012NVqvJndVVCJKggLDjmfPq\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSgrMElDaS25CwUs5Q4WMStk+dzMAUCapKEcQAKCRA4WMStk+dz\nMMVqAP0WsANYzKmpoLiZLv1H6cgtCr8wiYFDvsuLaRlUkjjswgD9G92AZhg+EuxI\nTIYIKf2RclICRmvu8gue3TQDQ5e6lws=\n=JMZT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T07:04:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1"