w_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/3188b9f6964a06855904eb2dded340a9276079d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T12:16:34Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T12:16:34Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"message":"chore: release v1.0.0-beta.0\n\nDrops the -dev safety catch, so this push publishes. The prerelease\nidentifier sends it to npm under the `beta` dist-tag; `latest` stays on\nv0.31.1 and a plain `npm install` keeps resolving there.\n\nThe former `## Unreleased` block becomes the release heading and is\nimmutable from here on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013Ngk27ipqscNEBRtonCV62","tree":{"sha":"56ca8dc1138888a6d7dc324c649ab412416cd1cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/trees/56ca8dc1138888a6d7dc324c649ab412416cd1cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/commits/3188b9f6964a06855904eb2dded340a9276079d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/3188b9f6964a06855904eb2dded340a9276079d4","node_id":"C_kwDOGEOuPNoAKDMxODhiOWY2OTY0YTA2ODU1OTA0ZWIyZGRlZDM0MGE5Mjc2MDc5ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/61b67e23bca34c14bd6ad7346fa12ef07da41e6f","sha":"61b67e23bca34c14bd6ad7346fa12ef07da41e6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/61b67e23bca34c14bd6ad7346fa12ef07da41e6f"}],"sha":"3188b9f6964a06855904eb2dded340a9276079d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/3188b9f6964a06855904eb2dded340a9276079d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/61b67e23bca34c14bd6ad7346fa12ef07da41e6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T11:26:16Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T11:26:16Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"message":"docs: make the README hold up for v1\n\nEvery factual claim checked against the source, the build scripts and the\nworkflows; every code example run against dist/ and type-checked against the\nshipped lib/*.d.ts under a consumer profile.\n\nWhat was wrong:\n\n- `hibernate()` was described as pausing reactivity. It suspends the\n  enclosing batch, quiet counter and effect stack; reactivity inside works\n  normally.\n- `beQuiet()` was described as silent mutation only. Reads do not subscribe\n  either.\n- The install note claimed pnpm and yarn do not add peer dependencies.\n  pnpm has auto-install-peers on by default since v8.\n- `pnpm world` and the CI scope paragraph both omitted `typecheck`.\n- The task table had no row for `typecheck` or `dist`, though the prose\n  around it names both.\n- The cart example annotated `Item` and the game-loop example used `hud` /\n  `measureFps` without declaring any of them.\n\nUnchanged because it holds: the \"API at a glance\" list matches the 33\npublished values name for name, the priorities (memo 1000, effect 0), the\nmaxDepth of 256, the counter self-correction, and the prerelease dist-tag\npolicy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013Ngk27ipqscNEBRtonCV62","tree":{"sha":"f9f5796f649a9edc0a8833364a01076c456d42da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/trees/f9f5796f649a9edc0a8833364a01076c456d42da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/commits/61b67e23bca34c14bd6ad7346fa12ef07da41e6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/61b67e23bca34c14bd6ad7346fa12ef07da41e6f","node_id":"C_kwDOGEOuPNoAKDYxYjY3ZTIzYmNhMzRjMTRiZDZhZDczNDZmYTEyZWYwN2RhNDFlNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/4afd4453d7843524ed370fe3865075bf5be43745","sha":"4afd4453d7843524ed370fe3865075bf5be43745","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/4afd4453d7843524ed370fe3865075bf5be43745"}],"sha":"61b67e23bca34c14bd6ad7346fa12ef07da41e6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/61b67e23bca34c14bd6ad7346fa12ef07da41e6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/4afd4453d7843524ed370fe3865075bf5be43745/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T10:15:39Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T10:15:39Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"message":"build: refresh the toolchain and install pnpm with pnpm/setup\n\nDependencies to their current releases: pnpm 11.21.0, Biome 2.5.8,\nRollup 4.62.4, npm-run-all2 9.0.3. `pnpm audit` is clean, for the whole\ntree and for `--prod`. @swc/core stays at 1.15.47: 1.16.0 is 17 hours\nold and pnpm''s release-age quarantine holds it back, which is the point\nof the quarantine.\n\nThe `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` for @spearwolf/eventize@6.0.0 goes —\nthat release is ten days old now, so the exclude was a no-op keeping\nthe peer dependency exempt from a policy it no longer needs an\nexemption from.\n\nBoth workflows install pnpm through pnpm/setup@v2, the successor\npnpm/action-setup names for pnpm v11 and newer. The old action\nbootstraps pnpm with `npm ci`, points PNPM_HOME at that\nnode_modules/.bin — whose top level carries a `pnpm` shim, exactly\nwhat hasLegacyHomeDirShim() reads as the v10 layout — and then reaches\nthe pinned version via `pnpm self-update`, the one code path that\nemits \"Detected a pnpm v10 installation layout at PNPM_HOME\". Every\njob logged it. pnpm/setup unpacks the self-contained binary and never\ncalls self-update.\n\nactions/setup-node stays: pnpm/setup can install the runtime itself,\nbut that route puts node on PATH without npm, which the deploy job\npublishes with.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://c