ttps://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/bdafa9504f6caaa04ae5c83d460db3e9fd25c448","node_id":"C_kwDOGEOuPNoAKGJkYWZhOTUwNGY2Y2FhYTA0YWU1YzgzZDQ2MGRiM2U5ZmQyNWM0NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/8c2581fea6fe109f66a1e2cb3f778ee3e5de5610","sha":"8c2581fea6fe109f66a1e2cb3f778ee3e5de5610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/8c2581fea6fe109f66a1e2cb3f778ee3e5de5610"}],"sha":"bdafa9504f6caaa04ae5c83d460db3e9fd25c448","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/bdafa9504f6caaa04ae5c83d460db3e9fd25c448"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/8c2581fea6fe109f66a1e2cb3f778ee3e5de5610/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T12:01:54Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T12:01:54Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"message":"docs: close out the remediation run for the twelve commissioned findings\n\nSix packages, six commits from a804676 to dd8affb, all twelve findings closed.\npnpm world green in all nine stages throughout: 673 tests in 59 files, up from\n655 in 58, branch coverage 95.95 -> 97.01.\n\nThe run is breaking and raises no version. TYPE-006 narrows a public type and\nthe SignalAutoMap/destroyObjectSignals teardowns now raise an AggregateError\nwhere they used to pass the first error through. But 1.0.0-dev is a gate, not a\nplaceholder: dropping the suffix is the release, and that decision belongs to\nthe maintainer. The Unreleased block carries 54 breaking-change entries.\n\nThree of the audit''s recommendations did not survive contact with the code, and\nthe plan records each: two of TEST-026''s eight guards are dead or redundant\ndefence and cannot be pinned, READ-016''s suggested justification explains the\nwrong thing, and READ-015 was wrong that its block was the only German comment\nleft in src.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SsDnGXmUPBJJ6ntj1jMPqi","tree":{"sha":"f9128dbda2b92f069972c0ff4971a143dddca5e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/trees/f9128dbda2b92f069972c0ff4971a143dddca5e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/commits/8c2581fea6fe109f66a1e2cb3f778ee3e5de5610","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/8c2581fea6fe109f66a1e2cb3f778ee3e5de5610","node_id":"C_kwDOGEOuPNoAKDhjMjU4MWZlYTZmZTEwOWY2NmExZTJjYjNmNzc4ZWUzZTVkZTU2MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/dd8affbd1bc1e7484f4195eabf5f925351e49a27","sha":"dd8affbd1bc1e7484f4195eabf5f925351e49a27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/dd8affbd1bc1e7484f4195eabf5f925351e49a27"}],"sha":"8c2581fea6fe109f66a1e2cb3f778ee3e5de5610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/8c2581fea6fe109f66a1e2cb3f778ee3e5de5610"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/commits/dd8affbd1bc1e7484f4195eabf5f925351e49a27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T11:58:53Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T11:58:53Z","email":"wolfger@spearwolf.de","name":"Wolfger Schramm"},"message":"docs: pin beforeRead to readAsValue and generalize the docs map (API-018, DX-008)\n\nbeforeRead now carries the same caveat in every place that teaches the\ndecorator: with readAsValue: true the property getter reads si.value and goes\npast the reader, so no property access fires the hook. Measured against a built\ndist/ in both directions before it was written. The docs map in CLAUDE.md now\ncovers every file under docs/ instead of an enumeration that rots on the next\naddition.\n\nTwo corrections ride along that carry no finding id of their own.\n\nThe exception to TYPE-006 was stated in four places and was wrong in three of\nthem: it hangs on the callback''s return type being any, annotated or inferred,\nnot on whether the callback is written inline or pre-declared. Correcting three\nand leaving one was not on the table. The claim that nothing else gets through\nis gone too — a pre-declared (v: T) => void callback compiles without any any,\nand this run does not document that gap, it just stops denying it.\n\npnpm world was documented as seven stages in CLAUDE.md and eight in AGENTS.md.\nIt runs nine, and the one that kept going missing is typecheck — the only stage\nthat type-checks src/**/*.spec.ts, and the stage every @ts-expect-error in this\nrepository has been resting on unmentioned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SsDnGXmUPBJJ6ntj1jMPqi","tree":{"sha":"3a55033aa05b98b7df31b6f01d94aa2ca4508212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/trees/3a55033aa05b98b7df31b6f01d94aa2ca4508212"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spearwolf/signalize/git/commits/dd8affbd1bc1e7484f4195eabf5f925351e49a27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf","id":12805,"login":"spearwolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spearwolf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/dd8affbd1bc1e7484f4195eabf5f925351e49a27","node_id":"C_kwDOGEOuPNoAKGRkOGFmZmJkMWJjMWU3NDg0ZjQxOTVlYWJmNWY5MjUzNTFlNDlhMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/spearwolf/signalize/commit/bbd767e20fca9f92219c2d9bbc94b0312f68418f