":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"chore(deps): require @native-router/core ^1.16.0 for the debug observability surface","tree":{"sha":"6b8276dfba1837a9101105d92af10aeac013e1cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/trees/6b8276dfba1837a9101105d92af10aeac013e1cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/commits/c9e3c982ffe6c323581678ae0f0a807585da13ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/react/commit/c9e3c982ffe6c323581678ae0f0a807585da13ad","node_id":"C_kwDOGH1f9NoAKGM5ZTNjOTgyZmZlNmMzMjM1ODE2NzhhZTBmMGE4MDc1ODVkYTEzYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/react/commit/e97015105053b1fac271c5bd3e84f2a4804a15a1","sha":"e97015105053b1fac271c5bd3e84f2a4804a15a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/e97015105053b1fac271c5bd3e84f2a4804a15a1"}],"sha":"c9e3c982ffe6c323581678ae0f0a807585da13ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/c9e3c982ffe6c323581678ae0f0a807585da13ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/e97015105053b1fac271c5bd3e84f2a4804a15a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:17:29Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:17:29Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(react): pass a prefetch strategy through TypedLink and TypedNavLink\n\nTypedLink and TypedNavLink now accept an optional prefetch prop (the\nPrefetchLink values: ''intent''/''render''/''viewport''/''none''). Declared,\nthe link renders through PrefetchLink on the interpolated target —\nevery strategy, the usePrefetch preview context and PrefetchLink''s\nclick path included — while the pattern narrowing (props typed through\nthe routes table) and the click-time missing-param backstop stay.\nOmitted, the link keeps the plain Link/NavLink path byte for byte.\n\nTypedNavLink''s prefetch flavor keeps the whole NavLink capability set:\nend/caseSensitive, the active-state className/style/children callbacks\nand ariaCurrent — the computation is extracted into a shared internal\nuseActiveState hook NavLink itself now uses. TypedPrefetchLink already\ncarried prefetch; its types and tests were complete.","tree":{"sha":"21e6cd4950cd3f274f2395f9b4489949a0a1a13a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/trees/21e6cd4950cd3f274f2395f9b4489949a0a1a13a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/commits/e97015105053b1fac271c5bd3e84f2a4804a15a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/react/commit/e97015105053b1fac271c5bd3e84f2a4804a15a1","node_id":"C_kwDOGH1f9NoAKGU5NzAxNTEwNTA1M2IxZmFjMjcxYzViZDNlODRmMmE0ODA0YTE1YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/react/commit/dca7e2bea5791a37334550200e05daec4433f129","sha":"dca7e2bea5791a37334550200e05daec4433f129","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/dca7e2bea5791a37334550200e05daec4433f129"}],"sha":"e97015105053b1fac271c5bd3e84f2a4804a15a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/e97015105053b1fac271c5bd3e84f2a4804a15a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/dca7e2bea5791a37334550200e05daec4433f129/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:35:46Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:35:46Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"test(react): 给被取代的 fire-and-forget navigate 挂 catch，适配 core 的取消语义变更\n\ncore 即将把被取代/被取消的 navigate() 从「永不 settle」改为以\nNavigationCancelledError 主动 reject。本仓测试在本地 monorepo 下直连\n../core 源码运行，integration 的 supersede 用例里 void navigate(router,\n''/a'') 被 /b 取代后将成为 unhandled rejection，vitest 报错退出。\n\n补一个 no-op catch：对旧 core（永不 settle，catch 不触发）与新语义\n（reject 被吞）都成立，不引入对未发布错误的任何 import 依赖——CI 单独\n检出本仓时仍回退 registry 的 core 1.15.x 运行。本仓运行时调用点\n（Link/TypedLink/PrefetchLink/use-blocker/use-setSearch）本就全部带\ncatch 或 guarded()，无需改动。","tree":{"sha":"33c94f065271b2fc569528ea2c4a2c3df9cf36d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/trees/33c94f065271b2fc569528ea2c4a2c3df9cf36d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-ro