y/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/656439b5a3a1577d1c81f93dc2ba53355a415fe9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:35:41Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:35:41Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"docs(react): 按特异性排序的真实匹配语义改写文档，替换陈旧的\"声明序先中即赢\"\n\ncore 自 a3ed26d（随 1.15.0 发布）起，match() 收集全部匹配链后按\nSEGMENT_SCORE 打分决胜：静态段(10) > 动态 `:param`(3) > splat(2)，逐段\n累加使更长的链胜出，声明顺序仅在平分时裁决。而 from-tanstack-router.md\n的迁移指引与 README（中英）的 Matching semantics 小节仍写着「按声明顺序\n匹配、先中即赢、不按特异性排序」——与用户实际拿到的行为直接矛盾。\n\n三处统一改写为准确描述（打分制 + 声明序仅平局裁决），并顺带修正同病的\nindex/fallback 条目：`path: ''''` 叶子如今由特异性天然屈居于以真实段匹配的\n兄弟之后，「声明在具体兄弟之后」的排序嘱咐已不再是兜底起作用的原因。","tree":{"sha":"ed9be1bafb8a493a93c291e42f40c5b6bc35ea47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/trees/ed9be1bafb8a493a93c291e42f40c5b6bc35ea47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/commits/656439b5a3a1577d1c81f93dc2ba53355a415fe9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"