bscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/0d67d432f6f7bedb22f6af3ad88d213c5ebc0d9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:24:13Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:24:13Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat: derive ctx.search from the route search schema via createRoutes\n\ncreateRoutes now returns SearchRoutesOf<T>: every level''s data loader\nand beforeLoad guard receive their ctx.search typed from the level''s\nown search schema output (SearchOutputOf), falling back to SearchInput\non schema-less levels — no manual Route<P, S> generics or callback\nannotations needed. Path literals, loader return types and the rest of\neach level pass through unchanged, so RoutePaths/TypedLink/Router keep\ntheir contracts; an explicit Route<P, S> generic still wins wherever\nwritten, and a callback annotation contradicting the schema is rejected\nat the property.\n\nRoute gains an S-typed beforeLoad (GuardContext<any, S> — the loose\nrouter typing avoids the recursive variance that would break Route''s\nassignability to BaseRoute). Depends on core ^1.8.0 for the guard\nsearch runtime and GuardContext''s search field.","tree":{"sha":"46eeb31f0d0205b95973271bc388b84e0489f92a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/trees/46eeb31f0d0205b95973271bc388b84e0489f92a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/commits/0d67d432f6f7bedb22f6af3ad88d213c5ebc0d9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/