s://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/commits/ac304c3cae326251acf9c7e23ddc360c3fe14728/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T05:21:59Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T05:21:59Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat: 导航链 AbortSignal 桥接 + core@1.5.0\n\n- Context/ResolveViewContext 新增 signal 字段，导航被取代/取消时 abort\n- resolveViewBase 透传 signal，手写 context 兼容 fallback（永不 abort 的 signal）\n- 升级 @native-router/core ^1.5.0（支持 signal）\n- 清理 pnpm-workspace.yaml 旧 core 版本白名单\n- 新增集成测试：A→B 导航链，A loader 的 signal 在 B 开始时 abort\n- 更新 README 文档和 data loader 示例","tree":{"sha":"cd710bcf2934b7c58208b30e0fa87a1c8d736f9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/trees/cd710bcf2934b7c58208b30e0fa87a1c8d736f9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/react/git/commits/ac304c3cae326251acf9c7e23ddc360c3fe14728","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravat