wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/8fa9dc4b644af946b4e7b363107dd344ca810d4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:31:47Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:31:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Reconcile captured JavaScript tool selections (#14436)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdvance [TURBO-6321](https://linear.app/vercel/issue/TURBO-6321), split\nfrom first-lock creation and updates in TURBO-6217.\n\n- Derive immutable, bounded resolution requests from captured native\ndeclarations and existing exact selections.\n- Preserve unchanged floating pins and unaffected selections;\ndistinguish permitted version resolution from Node npm/npx ownership\nchanges.\n- Reject missing/stale frozen state before resolution, remove obsolete\nselections deliberately, and publish complete candidates through\nsource/lock CAS without silent retries.\n\n```text\ncaptured declarations + previous lock + explicit mode\n  -> changed version IDs / ownership-only IDs\n  -> zero or one injected cohort resolver\n  -> validate unaffected selections and provenance\n  -> CAS publication, or read-only/ephemeral result\n```\n\nForce does not authorize refresh. The injected resolver still owns\nadapter semantic/integrity validation and complete cohort construction.\nNo HTTP provider, provisioning, CLI integration, or managed support\nclaim; TURBO-6217 remains incomplete.","tree":{"sha":"6d821337a457adf6c90e298bbca27b74f3d57e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/6d821337a457adf6c90e298bbca27b74f3d57e05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/8fa9dc4b644af946b4e7b363107dd344ca810d4c","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d821337a457adf6c90e298bbca27b74f3d57e05\nparent 3e176767eff17a214eef66c0f5c42754b7508692\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791469907 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791469907 -0600\n\nfeat: Reconcile captured JavaScript tool selections (#14436)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdvance [TURBO-6321](https://linear.app/vercel/issue/TURBO-6321), split\nfrom first-lock creation and updates in TURBO-6217.\n\n- Derive immutable, bounded resolution requests from captured native\ndeclarations and existing exact selections.\n- Preserve unchanged floating pins and unaffected selections;\ndistinguish permitted version resolution from Node npm/npx ownership\nchanges.\n- Reject missing/stale frozen state before resolution, remove obsolete\nselections deliberately, and publish complete candidates through\nsource/lock CAS without silent retries.\n\n```text\ncaptured declarations + previous lock + explicit mode\n  -> changed version IDs / ownership-only IDs\n  -> zero or one injected cohort resolver\n  -> validate unaffected selections and provenance\n  -> CAS publication, or read-only/ephemeral result\n```\n\nForce does not authorize refresh. The injected resolver still owns\nadapter semantic/integrity validation and complete cohort construction.\nNo HTTP provider, provisioning, CLI integration, or managed support\nclaim; TURBO-6217 remains incomplete.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE