/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/fedba139017728660eac421af7fab7bf10fda3b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:11:24Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:11:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Resolve native Node.js declarations into lock selections (#14432)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdvance [TURBO-6319](https://linear.app/vercel/issue/TURBO-6319), split\nfrom TURBO-6217, by composing native Node discovery, bounded official\nmetadata parsing, and validated lock selection.\n\n- Resolve native exact versions, aliases, and ranges while retaining\nsource priority and failure-policy provenance.\n- Bind advertised standard platforms to the same exact release, official\nartifact names/layouts, and supplied SHA-256 manifests. Never substitute\nan older release for a missing target.\n- Require deliberate bundled npm/npx ownership and exact metadata\nidentity; reject unsupported historical npx ownership and executable\ncollisions when composing a complete lock.\n\n```text\ncaptured Node requirements + approved release/checksum metadata\n  -> exact native resolution\n  -> validated Node ToolResolution\n  -> caller composes unaffected selections before atomic publication\n```\n\nNo network, filesystem mutation, process execution, provisioning,\nrefresh orchestration, or CLI wiring. Metadata-origin authentication\nremains the caller''s responsibility. Six-platform artifact selection\ndoes not qualify native Windows/musl promotion, and TURBO-6217 remains\nincomplete.","tree":{"sha":"379bdbf3fa1ce80f0e0ba2c1636f30834f7acee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/379bdbf3fa1ce80f0e0ba2c1636f30834f7acee9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/fedba139017728660eac421af7fab7bf10fda3b5","verification":{"payload":"tree 379bdbf3fa1ce80f0e0ba2c1636f30834f7acee9\nparent 7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791382284 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791382284 -0600\n\nfeat: Resolve native Node.js declarations into lock selections (#14432)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdvance [TURBO-6319](https://linear.app/vercel/issue/TURBO-6319), split\nfrom TURBO-6217, by composing native Node discovery, bounded official\nmetadata parsing, and validated lock selection.\n\n- Resolve native exact versions, aliases, and ranges while retaining\nsource priority and failure-policy provenance.\n- Bind advertised standard platforms to the same exact release, official\nartifact names/layouts, and supplied SHA-256 manifests. Never substitute\nan older release for a missing target.\n- Require deliberate bundled npm/npx ownership and exact metadata\nidentity; reject unsupported historical npx ownership and executable\ncollisions when composing a complete lock.\n\n```text\ncaptured Node requirements + approved release/checksum metadata\n  -> exact native resolution\n  -> validated Node ToolResolution\n  -> caller composes unaffected selections before atomic publication\n```\n\nNo network, filesystem mutation, process execution, provisioning,\nrefresh orchestration, or CLI wiring. Metadata-origin authentication\nremains the caller''s responsibility. Six-platform artifact selection\ndoes not qualify native Windows/musl promotion, and TURBO-6217 remains\nincomplete.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxlMMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA08QQACLlhQvMco7t4eQudlRPbmfp\n5PgunIqXMkZ7qptv1WM4sK0rrgDVVrfOa8zEYfYLuKkcHmr9bsQapM7QD8RejW76\njyIh3oP/E5wuW9e5RuCjIq/0ssHysr90vu1RSjIuXcjjBdHxyLwGuvaIy8oVobEd\nqnFpUf791r59IcdtrrFLVhK0ugJXp+SITWEBW+lwHYL4Vj5CTJUQ09jVIhpUgbUP\nXMHGCJphrim75DoUBLfJPxGoDtXBDn+aXOjRpV6mHlUG28mkVVBt8EUfLI3FrrWE\nHRJEYwFDyW5nApUZHgWLBlSCuqKe5oOZhzdhNjAqZJ8T+brtO1Pu+JDu492IPMSv\nrZRDI5p4I1HHLfzjUo3nBdPwKv3cW42KqSzWnodyvXEL3q8f8wMDwbP9nF24oSXN\n7qsJlu/ERNormUq4VT67GXUm6s1ma2uNmMkFKrMsLBctdbjKhTM0R5EGY8E4oxE+\nNTojPmJ3D0P5+g7lEUSm3w0J3iRumg00uZj7B8BgBvzBnH9J/7wXdJYjFQxMepdT\nnxPeUmlXzrBqQaAO0jepv4g2mqIRJMb7JxgQVPQRI5tvLW29TVeRZrpimzYapABX\nIAmPj+qfIG8S2VgFFri/nPaUn0LtEsIkGmrZ6UWfKXdqVfIFmpOAwKIA4rn2lwMQ\n1YxyeM6XpliyHynJPMVK\n=+9ZL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T14:11:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/fedba139017728660eac421af7fab7bf10fda3b5","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKGZlZGJhMTM5MDE3NzI4NjYwZWFjNDIxYWY3ZmFiN2JmMTBmZGEzYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab","sha":"7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab"}],"sha":"fedba139017728660eac421af7fab7bf10fda3b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/fedba139017728660eac421af7fab7bf10fda3b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:10:42Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:10:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Provision locked pnpm with managed Node launchers (#14431)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdvance [TURBO-6206](https://linear.app/vercel/issue/TURBO-6206) beyond\nregistry metadata parsing to a locked pnpm provisioning adapter.\n\n- Validate exact lock layout, package/version/bin identity, canonical\nregistry provenance, authored integrity, and mandatory SHA-512 plus\nlocked SHA-256 before staging.\n- Preserve the full verified resource tree and export launchers bound to\nthe same generation''s selected managed Node, never ambient\nNode/Corepack.\n- Prepare fresh Node and pnpm before one complete-inventory\nreconciliation; reuse only a healthy matching generation and repair\nstale shims.\n\n```text\nlocked Node + locked pnpm + complete desired inventory\n  -> prepare verified Node and pnpm resources\n  -> reconcile once\n  -> one generation with managed-Node-bound pnpm/pnpx launchers\n```\n\nNo resolution, dependency installation, lifecycle hooks, probing, or CLI\nactivation. Windows/musl promotion remains fail-closed and unqualified;\nthis does not satisfy Windows invocation qualification or complete the\nsetup orchestration milestone.","tree":{"sha":"e30419ee18e41d52e83af4c79d7c4b9919b3fb3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/e30419ee18e41d52e83af4c79d7c4b9919b3fb3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab","verification":{"payload":"tree e30419ee18e41d52e83af4c79d7c4b9919b3fb3e\nparent f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791382242 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791382242 -0600\n\nfeat: Provision locked pnpm with managed Node launchers (#14431)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdvance [TURBO-6206](https://linear.app/vercel/issue/TURBO-6206) beyond\nregistry metadata parsing to a locked pnpm provisioning adapter.\n\n- Validate exact lock layout, package/version/bin identity, canonical\nregistry provenance, authored integrity, and mandatory SHA-512 plus\nlocked SHA-256 before staging.\n- Preserve the full verified resource tree and export launchers bound to\nthe same generation''s selected managed Node, never ambient\nNode/Corepack.\n- Prepare fresh Node and pnpm before one complete-inventory\nreconciliation; reuse only a healthy matching generation and repair\nstale shims.\n\n```text\nlocked Node + locked pnpm + complete desired inventory\n  -> prepare verified Node and pnpm resources\n  -> reconcile once\n  -> one generation with managed-Node-bound pnpm/pnpx launchers\n```\n\nNo resolution, dependency installation, lifecycle hooks, probing, or CLI\nactivation. Windows/musl promotion remains fail-closed and unqualified;\nthis does not satisfy Windows invocation qualification or complete the\nsetup orchestration milestone.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxlLiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlOoQADG9PdxSIGpnpAlul4Inpcyk\nRiYrENJ+owYxwsRpHgT4EJmMetyU6y7y+KYU/ax6wNp5N6GZ6ZLFLkJPZq+MH4z1\n+WXA/wUsSMnWxobXxyO9oUhndGj0mmWZvSGz1JS6PvwY6GMozeLgLniZ/9R4T3/A\nvyLmPoG1NWTbLwoHjir016FNIK07ZMp097OrN/8gqgEL2kty9sfbauJopcp7arQK\nFkTBgAONwnqi38uSoch6Tk7f8WI60upSxfI5eHmP96G2WS9jGfSCNJViLDczdOFN\nutYnb7q+XIDfGv8TPc0y5IpYH0s3rSjNx+UNu98CPxfkMBvGoWj6DVsd2wt2GJDc\nDuPgfNST6+b8bS9Wt4zTJFyJ2FP9htCnJjthvaoOEWPyrUeyhzuq656hlwOc/84P\nfTaxyCj7Pg3mxvoD52RIVcgWl++sshCFxh4J8qGvW13u7f7He0xZfU5jiRosFwce\nulxwDPsTf0ZrVmY1624CVHuLU9cZ2QbibWveSIvzKZ8T42mXeNY13/uqsmCtH6wT\nKNnoVToeKmw+Ri36BkkfcxmokDAwcH/BwT41SzfoqmuV3osuX8Ggf0hwDgnwHoMo\nTLJbPFKPOMj5mqiuYgVuxkVBWzDfeXd/7dvVzTxSdm9hR2wGtcXoOXcQUpSEjRbv\niqHVf/6W+J6tL310bsVF\n=95Zv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T14:10:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKDdjMWZiNTYxNGI1NDg2M2E4YTIyNWI4NDIyYjhlNzQwMTM1NDVmYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5","sha":"f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5"}],"sha":"7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/7c1fb5614b54863a8a225b8422b8e74013545fab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:08:25Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:08:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: Isolate optional root initialization from watcher services (#14427)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe [Windows\nshard](https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/actions/runs/37536812574/job/112519852594)\ntimed out waiting for\n`optional_root_requires_cargo_manifest_but_not_workspace_mode`. Its\nmanifest-eligibility assertions unnecessarily constructed rooted event\nsources, probed Git, and started a hash watcher.\n\n- Extract the shared graph initialization and watch-spec publication\noperations without changing production startup order or failure\nhandling.\n- Test all three eligibility cases directly, using only the required\nroot Cargo marker.\n- Preserve Root-only scope, no-JavaScript, and empty-watch-spec\nassertions. Seed stale markers and assert readiness so publication\ncannot pass as a no-op.\n\n```diff\n optional_root_requires_cargo_manifest_but_not_workspace_mode\n-  Construct rooted event sources, SCM, and HashWatcher\n-  Initialize the full subscriber\n+  Initialize the package graph\n+  Publish its watch spec, replacing stale markers and setting readiness\n```\n\n## Manual verification\n\nControlled fault injection on native Windows ARM64, using separately\nbuilt baseline and candidate binaries:\n\n- The baseline entered an event-controlled Git barrier and stayed\nblocked until release, then passed after 45 Git calls.\n- The candidate passed 25 isolated processes with Git, Cargo, and rustc\nshims blocked, with zero tool invocations and all assertions executed.\n\nThis demonstrates dependency isolation, not the exact cause of the\nhistorical CI hang. The guest was Windows 11 ARM64 rather than CI''s x64\nWindows Server runner.","tree":{"sha":"d237fde317f6f551a48a1c3d8bbb5f9d4401749c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/d237fde317f6f551a48a1c3d8bbb5f9d4401749c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5","verification":{"payload":"tree d237fde317f6f551a48a1c3d8bbb5f9d4401749c\nparent c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791382105 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791382105 +0000\n\ntest: Isolate optional root initialization from watcher services (#14427)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe [Windows\nshard](https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/actions/runs/37536812574/job/112519852594)\ntimed out waiting for\n`optional_root_requires_cargo_manifest_but_not_workspace_mode`. Its\nmanifest-eligibility assertions unnecessarily constructed rooted event\nsources, probed Git, and started a hash watcher.\n\n- Extract the shared graph initialization and watch-spec publication\noperations without changing production startup order or failure\nhandling.\n- Test all three eligibility cases directly, using only the required\nroot Cargo marker.\n- Preserve Root-only scope, no-JavaScript, and empty-watch-spec\nassertions. Seed stale markers and assert readiness so publication\ncannot pass as a no-op.\n\n```diff\n optional_root_requires_cargo_manifest_but_not_workspace_mode\n-  Construct rooted event sources, SCM, and HashWatcher\n-  Initialize the full subscriber\n+  Initialize the package graph\n+  Publish its watch spec, replacing stale markers and setting readiness\n```\n\n## Manual verification\n\nControlled fault injection on native Windows ARM64, using separately\nbuilt baseline and candidate binaries:\n\n- The baseline entered an event-controlled Git barrier and stayed\nblocked until release, then passed after 45 Git calls.\n- The candidate passed 25 isolated processes with Git, Cargo, and rustc\nshims blocked, with zero tool invocations and all assertions executed.\n\nThis demonstrates dependency isolation, not the exact cause of the\nhistorical CI hang. The guest was Windows 11 ARM64 rather than CI''s x64\nWindows Server runner.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxlJZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVfcQADxwF0+hcV3C1Nr96PuTaQ98\nqHhStgwI7ftxKFyfcvZmFUnWvx/YBJ5/G7BZ3/KBKhzX1atLJJyV6SC4gFg5YQzN\nF7wV6zxu5d6Z7quNwX4H6/9lFIvz93J//E90S5pQu1eRRAqXOUAbT5nN8D/IeCPf\nb1ZBX/ikZhxGl/gj30B+0EELK2jreTbw9/LSr9npBRrcD5dmLSm1iUWOGh4yXUPO\nkaoenhLDK+mceMUNLH/ETISLc5XmQFc5Nf1vWxmn385KiZ4F0e4z7AcsG2hjtwE+\nRz/eiOgqWhZAvq1UaY5rep0ic6tYt5T2FzWl/Iveb+DLBn4T7jQwmhh0xf4ZyRvD\n/7YO5SNi22kbFfrHYvz7TjYMIR+LYmnfooAyxsYwn5eaTEprd4o4Qrf4aaVkFZGZ\nwwturECxaUWNY2ZUH8FP84Cp1/Y+AXZLQhfKCEkpDrCljxgjb1h+xrd2leTlMIDC\n05YwKBBOADtikI4TYNptQfbyhexPbV3kInIA0Anip3VcNabkZh+N+djFazHQ9/Fb\nin815o/obLp5wKvNDmA9R9vCleIW8sDCxfdbrOumQ7zpDbEJ0ExgNBKbuNSk6r2P\nQRnz36FbR15migc3xbx9u4RLL0VLDUhHw2MAzV4R6jgyL1gwQ8iY0HeLYQVU/mKY\nnN4ubrUrpR7/tNZFmRaZ\n=BSYN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T14:08:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKGYyM2Q0MTUwYTQzMWRiN2QzNjg5YjQ4ZDNiM2NiOWYwMzVkNDMwZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941","sha":"c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941"}],"sha":"f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/f23d4150a431db7d3689b48d3b3cb9f035d430d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:01:00Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:01:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: Add fail-closed managed CLI selection (#14413)\n\n## Scope\n\nPreparatory native capability selection/probing for TURBO-6202, tracked\nin TURBO-6314. This API is not yet wired into root metadata gating or\nnormal `turbo run` dispatch; this PR does not complete TURBO-6202 or\nadvertise managed execution support.\n\n- Select standalone only when its capability report explicitly contains\nthe complete required lock-schema contract. Preserve a compatible\ninstalled native pin; reject an incompatible or unqueryable pin without\nglobal substitution or fetching.\n- Bound Linux/macOS native queries with nonblocking output reads, a\nthree-second deadline, capped stdout, and rejection of any stderr.\nRetain the exited root''s PID with `WNOWAIT` until process-group cleanup\nand reaping, avoiding PID/group reuse.\n- Fail closed for non-self probing on Windows and other unqualified\nplatforms. No Windows bounded-query or child-tree qualification is\nclaimed.\n- Cover exited parents, inherited pipes, background children, and\nescaped process groups. Group cleanup is best effort, not a sandbox;\nescaped native children are outside group confinement, and the\nregression fixture explicitly owns their cleanup.\n- Keep production capability support empty. Synthetic native test peers\ndo not establish activation, drift validation, task environments, or\nhashing support.\n\n```text\nresolved native pin?\n  absent → require complete global schema capability\n  present → bounded native query → require complete local schema capability\n  failure → diagnostic; never substitute or fetch\n```\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nThe schema, Node provisioning, and capability ABI prerequisites are\nmerged into `main` (#14400, #14402, and #14408). This PR now targets\n`main` and contains only the preparatory selection/probing slice, with\nno feature documentation. Root metadata gating and normal `turbo run`\nintegration remain separate work under TURBO-6202.\n\nCloses TURBO-6314.","tree":{"sha":"b3e2f6c8917f3e0b44ad7ebaba73043d32475231","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/b3e2f6c8917f3e0b44ad7ebaba73043d32475231"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941","verification":{"payload":"tree b3e2f6c8917f3e0b44ad7ebaba73043d32475231\nparent 9eb96736dd2aac252ef30df18177f06c0eecdec6\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791381660 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791381660 +0000\n\nrefactor: Add fail-closed managed CLI selection (#14413)\n\n## Scope\n\nPreparatory native capability selection/probing for TURBO-6202, tracked\nin TURBO-6314. This API is not yet wired into root metadata gating or\nnormal `turbo run` dispatch; this PR does not complete TURBO-6202 or\nadvertise managed execution support.\n\n- Select standalone only when its capability report explicitly contains\nthe complete required lock-schema contract. Preserve a compatible\ninstalled native pin; reject an incompatible or unqueryable pin without\nglobal substitution or fetching.\n- Bound Linux/macOS native queries with nonblocking output reads, a\nthree-second deadline, capped stdout, and rejection of any stderr.\nRetain the exited root''s PID with `WNOWAIT` until process-group cleanup\nand reaping, avoiding PID/group reuse.\n- Fail closed for non-self probing on Windows and other unqualified\nplatforms. No Windows bounded-query or child-tree qualification is\nclaimed.\n- Cover exited parents, inherited pipes, background children, and\nescaped process groups. Group cleanup is best effort, not a sandbox;\nescaped native children are outside group confinement, and the\nregression fixture explicitly owns their cleanup.\n- Keep production capability support empty. Synthetic native test peers\ndo not establish activation, drift validation, task environments, or\nhashing support.\n\n```text\nresolved native pin?\n  absent → require complete global schema capability\n  present → bounded native query → require complete local schema capability\n  failure → diagnostic; never substitute or fetch\n```\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nThe schema, Node provisioning, and capability ABI prerequisites are\nmerged into `main` (#14400, #14402, and #14408). This PR now targets\n`main` and contains only the preparatory selection/probing slice, with\nno feature documentation. Root metadata gating and normal `turbo run`\nintegration remain separate work under TURBO-6202.\n\nCloses TURBO-6314.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxlCcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAcwQAASOCJm02NFaGomKOirum97/\nMPXfEKIYkwuJMWMThrqboSYmTTMv+WQB67kCj58ywbmXkQ2oi6VgED7AYj36fUoe\nPSbj96GGcno0HNbxmrJN4+kTX7uhExDL4bQfGyAE6kvbBA2ED7GG6pFZNWTkkvxU\nVnFHSYJIIguukMtOLMjN9XI4U4crGXFBDz4VIQiG5kCLvaZuj15tMP6+EE1re56m\nxourExz73j7cFaSSRd7XGhmS9tK81WavTfbXRx6lYRw2KTAQMxfWkVseHQh0eyUr\nZreMhsrnGlRVRFkLl9hvQ/vDkX1kYIkwJ6jmXTwSreLeKY9QlH+ypmBVaVaybsQa\nlqDeeXWdXMGETUmEkhUH9X6lEHZVRk+JbsZfw1GtH1x2LE1/NeBqKkgjDT5+qQsB\nfZGGgjsnsWap8n1JWlCAyFEKJSLwP+0Fj0kLUgFMNjonftfUfSy4eDUNWxcgK9Fl\nIXV/J6et68neDeZXjd/tpeZwV9UhQJC84KOS+ddS2vOOfIpr4CI0hcByzTmu5Y8B\nO1/3XQNGO4ATonH0a4CH/p6MrXYSA0pYbrrm6DYJq5ZHKyjQOhPXc0p/KtwGE4u2\nySaQ55ZnzNC8z4d1FY8iFWgCrjPn1k7o/e+Lt6FHklVBlZwJqWfSuaZBHMs2OpMe\n6c6PbJrFwqfd9HIJ9JB9\n=FSF9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T14:01:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKGM4YjUxM2MxYjRiYzNlZTUzODI3ZDIwMmY0OTczNDkzMGZkNjE5NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/9eb96736dd2aac252ef30df18177f06c0eecdec6","sha":"9eb96736dd2aac252ef30df18177f06c0eecdec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/9eb96736dd2aac252ef30df18177f06c0eecdec6"}],"sha":"c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/c8b513c1b4bc3ee53827d202f49734930fd61941"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/9eb96736dd2aac252ef30df18177f06c0eecdec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:38:39Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:38:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Compare setup source snapshots before lock publication (#14428)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdvance [TURBO-6309](https://linear.app/vercel/issue/TURBO-6309) without\nadding resolution or installation to the lock writer.\n\n- Capture bounded lock, native declaration, root flag, and policy\nbytes/presence without initializing storage.\n- Compare captured state under the stable writer guard, and recheck\nafter staging immediately before atomic promotion.\n- Move writer bookkeeping to Git-ignored, protected storage. Reject\nstale identical candidates, unsupported aliases/sources, and silent\nretries.\n\n```text\ncapture inputs -> resolve outside guard -> acquire writer guard\n  unchanged lock and source bytes?\n    no  -> conflict; preserve previous lock\n    yes -> stage -> recheck -> atomic promotion\n```\n\nThis is a native JS snapshot-publication API, not setup CLI or resolver\nwiring. TURBO-6203 still needs integration.\n\n## Manual Windows qualification\n\nAn external public-API harness on native Windows ARM64 verified eight\npinned-handle rename/delete denials, ten real junction rejection\nplacements with untouched outside sentinels, six config CAS transitions,\nand contained concurrent-writer cancellation/recovery.\n\nReal symlink fixtures were blocked by Windows privilege error 1314;\nthose assertions remain unqualified. No Developer Mode or global\nconfiguration change was made. This does not qualify x64 CI or managed\nWindows tool promotion.","tree":{"sha":"7ab1d8a318c8103ad4c471d2353488a8cba4f3f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/7ab1d8a318c8103ad4c471d2353488a8cba4f3f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/9eb96736dd2aac252ef30df18177f06c0eecdec6","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ab1d8a318c8103ad4c471d2353488a8cba4f3f4\nparent 494d3106a43b7eb0214ac6b200feb7b9e8bf237c\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791380319 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791380319 -0600\n\nfeat: Compare setup source snapshots before lock publication (#14428)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdvance [TURBO-6309](https://linear.app/vercel/issue/TURBO-6309) without\nadding resolution or installation to the lock writer.\n\n- Capture bounded lock, native declaration, root flag, and policy\nbytes/presence without initializing storage.\n- Compare captured state under the stable writer guard, and recheck\nafter staging immediately before atomic promotion.\n- Move writer bookkeeping to Git-ignored, protected storage. Reject\nstale identical candidates, unsupported aliases/sources, and silent\nretries.\n\n```text\ncapture inputs -> resolve outside guard -> acquire writer guard\n  unchanged lock and source bytes?\n    no  -> conflict; preserve previous lock\n    yes -> stage -> recheck -> atomic promotion\n```\n\nThis is a native JS snapshot-publication API, not setup CLI or resolver\nwiring. TURBO-6203 still needs integration.\n\n## Manual Windows qualification\n\nAn external public-API harness on native Windows ARM64 verified eight\npinned-handle rename/delete denials, ten real junction rejection\nplacements with untouched outside sentinels, six config CAS transitions,\nand contained concurrent-writer cancellation/recovery.\n\nReal symlink fixtures were blocked by Windows privilege error 1314;\nthose assertions remain unqualified. No Developer Mode or global\nconfiguration change was made. This does not qualify x64 CI or managed\nWindows tool promotion.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx