e-flag guidance\n```\n\n- Remove the `experimentalSetup` section and its cross-reference,\nintroduced by #14361 and expanded by #14385.\n- Defer documentation of the root future flag and setup command controls\nwithout changing their implementation.\n- Keep standalone installation documentation completely unchanged. No\nnew documentation is added.\n- Preserve unrelated configuration guidance, CLI help, schemas, code\ncomments, installation endpoints, and root agent guidance.\n\nThis narrowly scoped draft is separate from the closed #14397 and does\nnot reopen it.","tree":{"sha":"62a97b28b74b5e0d18b7245c90e5d668864b2e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/62a97b28b74b5e0d18b7245c90e5d668864b2e30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/0c1db56e20fdc06085cce3874b330cbe06c1dc75","verification":{"payload":"tree 62a97b28b74b5e0d18b7245c90e5d668864b2e30\nparent ebf78f69d96bc213bd38a99754e782027f8d40bb\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791312102 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791312102 -0600\n\ndocs: Remove premature setup guidance (#14409)\n\n## Summary\n\nDefer premature `turbo setup` guidance until the setup project is\ncomplete. This draft changes only\n`apps/docs/content/docs/reference/configuration.mdx`.\n\n```diff\n reference/configuration.mdx\n- experimentalSetup root future-flag opt-in\n- Setup command controls, conflicts, and lock guidance\n  Existing future-flag guidance\n```\n\n- Remove the `experimentalSetup` section and its cross-reference,\nintroduced by #14361 and expanded by #14385.\n- Defer documentation of the root future flag and setup command controls\nwithout changing their implementation.\n- Keep standalone installation documentation completely unchanged. No\nnew documentation is added.\n- Preserve unrelated configuration guidance, CLI help, schemas, code\ncomments, installation endpoints, and root agent guidance.\n\nThis narrowly scoped draft is separate from the clos