ub.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/7dba02edee4ebe63b68cfbcad0d5fde8e85da24f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:33:08Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:33:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: Add installed-wrapper process launcher (#14401)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add a reusable, offline package-shaped launcher for the standalone\nnative binary and installed npm wrapper, without `TURBO_BINARY_PATH`.\n- Exercise optional-package resolution, nested-directory local handoff,\nnpm script/user-agent context, bounded output capture, exit results,\nsignals, and panic/timeout cleanup.\n- Reuse the existing graceful-shutdown process-group and wait helpers.\nLeave the exhaustive Unix and native Windows parity matrices to their\nseparate issues.\n\n```text\nStandalone native ─────────────────────┐\nInstalled turbo/bin/turbo → @turbo/host ├→ Repository-local native (when present)\nnpm run → node_modules/.bin/turbo ─────┘\n```\n\nCloses TURBO-6255.","tree":{"sha":"077b22807219f1584789739e816071bbea612f7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/077b22807219f1584789739e816071bbea612f7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/7dba02edee4ebe63b68cfbcad0d5fde8e85da24f","verification":{"payload":"tree 077b22807219f1584789739e816071bbea612f7b\nparent 710f8424174bef243d6fd594bbdfb97aced2e119\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791297188 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791297188 -0600\n\ntest: Add installed-wrapper process launcher (#14401)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add a reusable, offline package-shaped launcher for the standalone\nnative binary and installed npm wrapper, without `TURBO_BINARY_PATH`.\n- Exercise optional-package resolution, nested-directory local handoff,\nnpm script/user-agent context, bounded output capture, exit results,\nsignals, and panic/timeout cleanup.\n- Reuse the existing graceful-shutdown process-group and wait helpers.\nLeave the exhaustive Unix and native Windows parity matrices to their\nseparate issues.\n\n```text\nStandalone native ─────────────────────┐\nInstalled turbo/bin/turbo → @turbo/host ├→ Repository-local native (when present)\nnpm run → node_modules/.bin/turbo ─────┘\n```\n\nCloses TURBO-6255.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxQakCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjP4QAIgZrwP6tY4TN+0waZsZ4jDd\nxaSyAAdQM/XpuR6WMY3bHou/bDp4Vb5yjh9I7trzdLpsd3s0tx9PTPzgjyJlLitI\nMi8f/aWp7kW0ekFBzbHbzpIcMek8OcO6diNJlT0TKk2fuobFviaQDBHAC0lOzlDW\nTf4xDJ2TD4bRq1ICZxd03JcHF7rQJ/ADdC49NEpY/BYi7kg5yDIZUO/mLvtoYMfY\nOc2sZZZCe4K0BgmBNCZlr8W1a/o11RGwV/LBpWCbVOFxHa5YZT16GlQ7KuxErv6y\ns8T25OxP/Qvm74ORTZ4aJejPbiXX3imw62sRkrS3zuQ9Vftli0+YISAj16iADNIW\newZWbrLVxaRjfE96grzHm4DdYpazWRT+AGaPQ79A8rTGWpGDTuTwja9jpfzawgBR\nwhx83DUBQCaaF5/deCcCEn6pw5o4/pTUKQVduh28OUPDVkYO7t1C8xMCDnQQDHMn\nnj7tuD8kdZ290pJZPNhNlbobG5Jorw81fN6VGIYlt7ymtXziM9FFFoRvpiG2w3Cy\n0TCBbf3d51yX0V/kqwflnDJdt3J4rWmQSCgiv8gwSktGV3QOCSWUUDBEs4dCfZ6d\njPNyti1sqkqoskXJ+g+gACu+AHiXMz7KSQaNaiRipLO3x3AM9QXf0yMn1I8eiKJM\n7vN30RndlkAevJK4axzy\n=lKEu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T14:33:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com