e":"2026-10-06T13:25:48Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:25:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Safely extract verified ZIP archives (#14394)\n\n### Summary\n\nFixes TURBO-6204. Extends #14384''s shared archive boundary without\nadding HTTP, installation, or CLI wiring.\n\n```text\nVerifiedArtifact\n  TAR / TAR.GZ / ZIP32 (stored or DEFLATE)\n    Bounded decoding + strict record validation\n    Shared portable paths, layout, and node limits\n    Owned private staging\n    Error or drop -> Remove staging\n```\n\n- Validate ZIP local/central metadata, exact record coverage, data\ndescriptors, decoded sizes, and CRC before writing each payload.\n- Reject encrypted/unsupported ZIP entries, links, special files,\nWindows path hazards, collisions, malformed metadata, ZIP64, and split\ndisks. Support bounded timestamp/UID/GID extras without applying\nownership or timestamps.\n- Preserve safe Unix executable bits and reuse cleanup-safe staging.\nKeep the intentionally conservative ZIP subset documented in the crate.\n\n### Manual verification\n\nOn native macOS, independently generated archives with Python''s\nstandard-library ZIP writer: eight stored/DEFLATE, seekable/streaming,\nand extra-field variants, plus five traversal, Windows-device, symlink,\nunsupported-codec, and decompression-bomb fixtures. Valid payloads,\nexecutable modes, private directories, and owned cleanup passed,\nincluding execution under `umask 0700`; malicious fixtures were\nrejected.\n\nAdversarial review tightened descriptor handling when the CRC equals the\noptional signature, extra-field validation, and reserved metadata\nrejection. Native Windows qualification remains outstanding; this does\nnot claim complete platform or tool-installation support. ZIP links\nremain unsupported; validated relative TAR symlinks are preserved from\n#14393.","tree":{"sha":"d67c28c9832119b267127e0e0b40c01da536a2e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/d67c28c9832119b267127e0e0b40c01da536a2e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/710f8424174bef243d6fd594bbdfb97aced2e119","verification":{"payload":"tree d67c28c9832119b267127e0e0b40c01da536a2e9\nparent bca05164dbf5f9eadf46d7e39e0c4f348d1995ea\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791293148 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791293148 -0600\n\nfeat: Safely extract verified ZIP archives (#14394)\n\n### Summary\n\nFixes TURBO-6204. Extends #14384''s shared archive boundary without\nadding HTTP, installation, or CLI wiring.\n\n```text\nVerifiedArtifact\n  TAR / TAR.GZ / ZIP32 (stored or DEFLATE)\n    Bounded decoding + strict record validation\n    Shared portable paths, layout, and node limits\n    Owned private staging\n    Error or drop -> Remove staging\n```\n\n- Validate ZIP local/central metadata, exact record coverage, data\ndescriptors, decoded sizes, and CRC before writing each payload.\n- Reject encrypted/unsupported ZIP entries, links, special files,\nWindows path hazards, collisions, malformed metadata, ZIP64, and split\ndisks. Support bounded timestamp/UID/GID extras without applying\nownership or timestamps.\n- Preserve safe Unix executable bits and reuse cleanup-safe staging.\nKeep the intentionally conservative ZIP subset documented in the crate.\n\n### Manual verification\n\nOn native macOS, independently generated archives with Python''s\nstandard-library ZIP writer: eight stored/DEFLATE, seekable/streaming,\nand extra-field variants, plus five traversal, Windows-device, symlink,\nunsupported-codec, and decompression-bomb fixtures. Valid payloads,\nexecutable modes, private directories, and owned cleanup passed,\nincluding execution under `umask 0700`; malicious fixtures were\nrejected.\n\nAdversarial review tightened descriptor handling when the CRC equals the\noptional signature, extra-field validation, and reserved metadata\nrejection. Native Windows qualification remains outstanding; this does\nnot claim complete platform or tool-installation support. ZIP links\nremain unsupported; validated relative TAR symlinks are preserved from\n#14393.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxPbcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFAEQADkgiWu8TCIbiVafbbTTwYcx\ns5kRQneZi4ovY4tqRMx7wjoZcIpV29wzeDWLyfUFkVAVJvGcUrkYrIELZiShzCoY\nJ4I/1msyQAkctRiVOs/X3FMQgWAF+nPEYdXAVy6E5KcSyqHWVM9quTKow5uq9RI/\nhyCJPSJ8mfUIiBEvvY+BgPWQ85r1CRQCKFrhuzqqnLMqWLOuRJo0/36+rtamYosW\n+sNFOs/g3yY8K57I4yLfBQVxHf8tNTaXhsy3MVQJc6mOKx5rMuMhlE4hr2oQYp5/\n/YQyr1tlFmzmy/MAZp/kwnJylZ2SzeOwalGwJywqmIB5+fTLdauEdQXvn+ECwaG3\nH+WbRsO9BZ3ATgLHXAwA4KNbK2ziWg52/xtkLxw7EIQHlmpC78xTWSj4zU0dCOKB\nl0B++E46audjxd5IzpVERlmm6GmlW0et2RyFv+dz8fbHNcgqBxJXV74YgUb49N/2\nkTpVUrwpwSw9XXBlTUbWRBMogrXSfDgdM5YTUR4CUYzO2iERwHWOvMzcJ46d88nl\n0e5JrNabls/Zm6m26Cg11V7po3ZyGqOSwsJ7xu2P45y4BBZNW5hFNlYXAHAY0i2z\nclkIzbIu646PPcDqWH84h4bezgfu3t8f/qgtZeACzdHFUmTU1N3V8JpZILpvkq+y\nh5MudHhrwlUY2eAP5ujs\n=iWbM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T13:25:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/710f8424174bef243d6fd594bbdfb97aced2e119","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKDcxMGY4NDI0MTc0YmVmMjQzZDZmZDU5NGJiZGZiOTdhY2VkMmUxMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/bca05164dbf5f9eadf46d7e39e0c4f348d1995ea","sha":"bca05164dbf5f9eadf46d7e39e0c4f348d1995ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/bca05164dbf5f9eadf46d7e39e0c4f348d1995ea"}],"sha":"710f8424174bef243d6fd594bbdfb97aced2e119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/710f8424174bef243d6fd594bbdfb97aced2e119"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/bca05164dbf5f9eadf46d7e39e0c4f348d1995ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:23:55Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:23:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Invalidate managed repositories when turbo.lock changes (#14396)\n\nTreat the committed root `turbo.lock` as a default global file when\n`experimentalSetup` is enabled, sharing the rule between package and\ntask-input change detection.\n\n```text\nexperimentalSetup + turbo.lock committed in HEAD\n  root turbo.lock changes\n    Select all packages and tasks\n      --affected · git-range filters · turbo query\n```\n\nUnconfigured repositories and package-local `turbo.lock` files retain\nexisting behavior. Configured global dependency exclusions cannot\nsuppress the managed lock change. The opt-in check uses Git tree\nmembership without reading or fetching lock contents.\n\nFixes TURBO-6276","tree":{"sha":"933e2c768869274016e6de6a52ee332f9615f194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/933e2c768869274016e6de6a52ee332f9615f194"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/bca05164dbf5f9eadf46d7e39e0c4f348d1995ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 933e2c768869274016e6de6a52ee332f9615f194\nparent 52bea749ff98079d89ee968657d2a3859cd77c07\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791293035 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791293035 -0600\n\nfix: Invalidate managed repositories when turbo.lock changes (#14396)\n\nTreat the committed root `turbo.lock` as a default global file when\n`experimentalSetup` is enabled, sharing the rule between package and\ntask-input change detection.\n\n```text\nexperimentalSetup + turbo.lock committed in HEAD\n  root turbo.lock changes\n    Select all packages and tasks\n      --affected · git-range filters · turbo query\n```\n\nUnconfigured repositories and package-local `turbo.lock` files retain\nexisting behavior. Configured global dependency exclusions cannot\nsuppress the managed lock change. The opt-in check uses Git tree\nmembership without reading or fetching lock contents.\n\nFixes TURBO-6276","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxPZrCRC1aQ7