, `^build` includes the dependency''s build task, not its lint\ntask; `^lint` includes its lint task.\n\nCloses #14387.\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6f28977f47e89b11c00e1703b2dfc70b8e7a9d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/a6f28977f47e89b11c00e1703b2dfc70b8e7a9d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/46064de17f9f85755963ef146e0cc289f5298fbd","verification":{"payload":"tree a6f28977f47e89b11c00e1703b2dfc70b8e7a9d2\nparent 0b2a3a5f0f307ab681ccf8bb29315ff5ca49a729\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791289348 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791289348 -0600\n\ndocs: Clarify task graph filter traversal (#14392)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Correct `filterUsingTasks` documentation: `...` traverses the Task\nGraph instead of the Package Graph.\n- Clarify that package dependencies alone do not select tasks in\ndependency packages. No runtime behavior changes.\n\nManually verified the dependency-selection matrix: with the flag\nenabled, `^build` includes the dependency''s build task, not its lint\ntask; `^lint` includes its lint task.\n\nCloses #14387.\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxOgECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAny4QAABapPEo0oGoJ4ZenQbSlMhr\n+uAoyDwXmpylKqwEFedzxVDEd8NXNjtXHNBmyHQbH6vVy6RDbXsxNM/9SzPWETZI\nzgy8f0DpgZpsmzXwrcqmXU0RrxrClf6CZvP80QOXQWAsF39zhd2Ii2yeOI+DacVB\nUSs43C5oQ/PLAiTN4C7JjQaFQXkGtld+3QWSSb4Okzq1n0LJtpt9+jZtWaxn730c\nH0mNYeuGmUzir5B5PXp32qecHH50BPRV8CFdYwMiPmM0D7XegR0qHHVULVL95kf2\nGiVYm3WdRrNOFooJmnzUeB4TkkDNlbCAjB/fj0udnKI/WWcU0qJv6CBnnmAzqMP/\nW5t1pAfbm40WfDb2mBuICUOd3qD2ZRBS+yUFMohxm2RFB02WheQ4Hq2+0HK2ErMA\noPxiy8g+TbrPqnayHpZ5Xi7kpUdlIM0FFVhsMxEXoFdlLjnWeRki5AheSAbXXYiT\n13y9R6nEnv0hbE+b5nD/WGRMTq9XPHIbGamieZkseCn2R+iTL