rs/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/0b2a3a5f0f307ab681ccf8bb29315ff5ca49a729/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T05:15:04Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T05:15:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: Consolidate CI into one required summary (#14390)\n\n## Summary\n\nRun Rust quality checks through Turborepo and consolidate the required\nCI checks into one workflow graph and one merge gate.\n\n```text\nTest workflow\n├── Quality → Turborepo quality task\n├── JavaScript package tests\n├── Rust, native package, schema, and integration tests\n├── Trusted release/review validation\n└── CI Summary → The single required check\n```\n\n- Replace the separate test summaries with a fail-closed `CI Summary`.\nFailures, cancellations, missing results, and unexpected skips cannot\npass the gate.\n- Preserve intentional automated-release and push-only skips. Validate\nrelease PRs once before skipping test jobs.\n- Convert the quality, JavaScript tests, and release/review checks into\nreusable workflows. Keep the release/review validator checked out from\nthe trusted default branch.\n- Rerun the unified graph on PR edits and review submissions/dismissals\nso the merge gate reflects current review state.\n- Update both automated release workflows to find and approve the single\nparent CI run.\n- Preserve strict Clippy flags, all-features license coverage,\ncargo-deny 0.19.2, and fork-safe Remote Cache behavior. Cache formatting\nand license checks; leave Clippy''s existing uncached setting unchanged.\n- Use direct Zig, Cap’n Proto, cargo-deny, and turbo setup commands\nwhere action wrappers are unnecessary.\n\n## Merge gate\n\nReplace the required `Test Summary`, `JS Test Summary`, `Release\nSemantic Validation`, and `Quality` contexts with `CI Summary`. Keep the\nexisting review requirements and bypass permissions unchanged.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-4[bot] <312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bd0c42e5e2db0775bea939936e9beb041daad5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/1bd0c42e5e2db0775bea939936e9beb041daad5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/0b2a3a5f0f307ab681ccf8bb29315ff5ca49a729","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bd0c42e5e2db0775bea939936e9beb041daad5f\nparent 2872e914a1fc4a548a3f1a07c44712c7fcec5b06\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791263704 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791263704 -0600\n\nchore: Consolidate CI into one required summary (#14390)\n\n## Summary\n\nRun Rust quality checks through Turborepo and consolidate the required\nCI checks into one workflow graph and one merge gate.\n\n```text\nTest workflow\n├── Quality → Turborepo quality task\n├── JavaScript package tests\n├── Rust, native package, schema, and integration tests\n├── Trusted release/review validation\n└── CI Summary → The single required check\n```\n\n- Replace the separate test summaries with a fail-closed `CI Summary`.\nFailures, cancellations, missing results, and unexpected skips cannot\npass the gate.\n- Preserve intentional automated-release and push-only skips. Validate\nrelease PRs once before skipping test jobs.\n- Convert the quality, JavaScript tests, and release/review checks into\nreusable workflows. Keep the release/review validator checked out from\nthe trusted default branch.\n- Rerun the unified graph on PR edits and review submissions/dismissals\nso the merge gate reflects current review state.\n- Update both automated release workflows to find and approve the single\nparent CI run.\n- Preserve strict Clippy flags, all-features license coverage,\ncargo-deny 0.19.2, and fork-safe Remote Cache behavior. Cache formatting\nand license checks; leave Clippy''s existing uncached setting unchanged.\n- Use direct Zig, Cap’n Proto, cargo-deny, and turbo setup commands\nwhere action wrappers are unnecessary.\n\n## Merge gate\n\nReplace the required `Test Summary`, `JS Test Summary`, `Release\nSemantic Validation`, and `Quality` contexts with `CI Summary`. Keep the\nexisting review requirements and bypass permissions unchanged.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-4[bot] <312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxIPYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcW4QAE9jdpeYo5Vgge67bXz4PDxG\nlZB9SKBJb88i95KxxNF4T7BMakBhzRlLYnbjtUahMqsesclxMaXUuMMySsP0XRhL\nAR7bXdlsySb1qAmE9XOv6rVIYHXznntoqCc74m7bByioMICV4JIVc5ytiL34vXsh\nuJxxbvShxh0ZATrQpiMq1R81i/heOhqiBH+qNVkTtMoDq2iuv3tCKMvrjhZZV0jn\n8N1twaEzUX2iAUQlHBSrc2FJ62yFvUipsrAS2L98ij9YemjnSPie5RC+wG11CkdA\n9wYu4hge5Ck7r0dsfAc4hUIeU+M4ax/thuvd9l4leHZUYfpC7gyTnSvgRQU6q5qi\negyq1nVS7bn3GnJHV2YrUH+Ua0ltYy6A1MKmfPb45KUNXIBWSukfbewQ7nEBGb6q\n9c69cw4CkCtWskIq15i0iwOQJFMewHPG95S3+R2/aBNXyIErif2RwnMFHZU0/f2V\n4slBy3VFSOkus1BFSGiMbzf9JFGAg2rO5ILL4YGNyqoqNy/O1lqxIGLLNPLNcbuX\n2MONJD4E4MIG5H40632A9a08b/ZxxgMga3iskYddDrHlhx+SzhYIChnf//ZO13gH\nUvZXa11H0Dvlfp9A/hzMPjg4T2zvFf2yzxGpFJNd18W2kK4zrDwOxtiGihLyqTOl\n5pY/l5Ciz6mewZ4XfNtd\n=e5ei\n-----END PGP SIG