l-gh-bot-4%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel-gh-bot-4","id":312518292,"login":"vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOEqCmlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-4%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-4%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-4%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-4%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-4%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-4%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/2872e914a1fc4a548a3f1a07c44712c7fcec5b06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:54:35Z","email":"312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:54:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: Remove Factory branch naming restrictions (#14391)\n\n## Summary\n- Allow Factory to create and update pull requests without an `agents/`\nprefix or branch-name character-pattern restriction.\n- Accept trusted maintainer feedback regardless of branch naming while\npreserving collaborator permissions and exact-branch authorization.\n- Identify merge-notification updates through recorded Slack\nnotifications rather than branch prefixes, and safely encode branch\nnames in GitHub ref lookups.\n- Update Factory instructions, documentation, and regression coverage.\nAutomated runs retain their default daily branch names.\n\n## Existing issues\nThe Rust toolchain-pin mismatch and missing dependency/Sandbox API type\nerrors were reproduced on unchanged HEAD. They remain unchanged and\noutside this PR''s scope.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-4[bot] <312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com>\nCo-authored-by: vercel[bot] <35613825+vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"173e6f8db3c5e3eee5332337b5cf8cd2837c5743","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/173e6f8db3c5e3eee5332337b5cf8cd2837c5743"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/2872e914a1fc4a548a3f1a07c44712c7fcec5b06","verification":{"payload":"tree 173e6f8db3c5e3eee5332337b5cf8cd2837c5743\nparent 489d5e02cd4bb908ade90f50edeb4382202074d5\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-4[bot] <312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791262475 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791262475 -0600\n\nchore: Remove Factory branch naming restrictions (#14391)\n\n## Summary\n- Allow Factory to create and update pull requests without an `agents/`\nprefix or branch-name character-pattern restriction.\n- Accept trusted maintainer feedback regardless of branch naming while\npreserving collaborator permissions and exact-branch authorization.\n- Identify merge-notification updates through recorded Slack\nnotifications rather than branch prefixes, and safely encode branch\nnames in GitHub ref lookups.\n- Update Factory instructions, documentation, and regression coverage.\nAutomated runs retain their default daily branch names.\n\n## Existing issues\nThe Rust toolchain-pin mismatch and missing dependency/Sandbox API type\nerrors were reproduced on unchanged HEAD. They remain unchanged and\noutside this PR''s scope.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-4[bot] <312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com>\nCo-authored-by: vercel[bot] <35613825+vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxH8LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzEIQAKEVXd2+jElAgr2GF7uaoHzO\nfrXKOjgUJVDrSkPUko0t1D2iwUdKJAfx920d14nhwW66+OqDHWoLw9WVwZ2KXnuV\