":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: Remove Linear from factory (#14389)\n\n## Summary\n\nRemove Linear from the factory so the agent no longer receives Linear\nAgent Sessions or exposes Linear MCP tools.\n\n```diff\n apps/factory/\n-├── agent/channels/linear.ts\n-├── agent/connections/linear.ts\n-├── agent/lib/linear.ts\n-└── tests/linear.test.mjs\n```\n\nKeep `@vercel/connect` because the Slack integration still uses it.","tree":{"sha":"4c3dbad60fa2920fc121168ef0e0be0a25a4c978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/4c3dbad60fa2920fc121168ef0e0be0a25a4c978"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/7b237ef7bcf8d176bff3f0b92de97e00f7cdf683","verification":{"payload":"tree 4c3dbad60fa2920fc121168ef0e0be0a25a4c978\nparent 65931580ef710f9ae45a0da8010d7ff64bf58e73\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791256358 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791256358 -0600\n\nchore: Remove Linear from factory (#14389)\n\n## Summary\n\nRemove Linear from the factory so the agent no longer receives Linear\nAgent Sessions or exposes Linear MCP tools.\n\n```diff\n apps/factory/\n-├── agent/channels/linear.ts\n-├── agent/connections/linear.ts\n-├── agent/lib/linear.ts\n-└── tests/linear.test.mjs\n```\n\nKeep `@vercel/connect` because the Slack integration still uses it.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxGcmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9/YQAB4nRu7Afxhy4FOofm2hQyND\nw8msONYVxycRp2cv+UJbwrqvqWrqox1xd8aBNLUm6pfCF23Dy4XIHwt7xiMrXcY2\nBbfxT8YMBTaiFqF5rWslVZR3rnY7ktgkSsRrEJd+yh+PEmYWAMdBgxtawQbT1Y2q\nPp68Rh9Kwzfky5fzcvbnfZJ1njE6IEh6DJXe2AeTaLCi+MJhpoINW/kNGTprUUwJ\nZ6GyuMb5bxN3/hdyZ4qO2m0vBBceud0UON23M3gCyTvxlcfIugwyUedpkZAxLi4C\nvva/WKk+zXW6Qm52G+Mq4CpYZegcp7VNEveTK6R2NrzdyYbhhIneT4VRP7Kb/oe2\nLyT9J0uVsWlcILjPxsOpK30fyx6GlXLKfzO54ehafK+e/znG/voCfopX3f7vIShW\nLeqTkABn3nhjO2QSqygo6FedYv/yfsh7CQRqKIoCatKV3ZwBXwR8BfhClDzWbADM\nXQMj+/3nEY/Y3Lo7b9Orx1p9tzEWFoNR8bf3Ryot85F5EnUXNbGtwwD+58hdRlVY\nG2+3fvBli