"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/65931580ef710f9ae45a0da8010d7ff64bf58e73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T03:06:26Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T03:06:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Deflake concurrent agent guidance updates (#14388)\n\n### Description\n\nThe concurrent agent-guidance test can fail when a contender observes\nthe lock file before its owner writes the PID. The previous ten 1 ms\nretries assume the owner gets scheduled quickly enough.\n\nTreat incomplete or invalid PID locks as contention instead. This\nbest-effort update leaves both `AGENTS.md` and the lock untouched.\n\n```diff\n Agent-guidance lock acquisition\n- Retry an invalid PID ten times, then return an error\n+ Return Locked without modifying either file\n```\n\n- Add deterministic coverage for empty and malformed lock files,\nincluding recovery once the lock is removed.\n- Start concurrent workers together with a barrier, join every worker\nbefore asserting, and require exactly one update.","tree":{"sha":"ec58ebe54e6aec4bcf77b748b6116ff2799aa624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/ec58ebe54e6aec4bcf77b748b6116ff2799aa624"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/65931580ef710f9ae45a0da8010d7ff64bf58e73","verification":{"payload":"tree ec58ebe54e6aec4bcf77b748b6116ff2799aa624\nparent 5913324d69ddea29bac18f9338f2fd846b00c415\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791255986 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791255986 -0600\n\nfix: Deflake concurrent agent guidance updates (#14388)\n\n### Description\n\nThe concurrent agent-guidance test can fail when a contender observes\nthe lock file before its owner writes the PID. The previous ten 1 ms\nretries assume the owner gets scheduled quickly enough.\n\nTreat incomplete or invalid PID locks as contention instead. This\nbest-effort update leaves both `AGENTS.md` and the lock untouched.\n\n```diff\n Agent-guidance lock acquisition\n- Retry an invalid PID ten times, then return an error\n+ Return Locked without modifying either file\n```\n\n- Add deterministic coverage for empty and malformed lock files,\nincluding recovery once the lock is removed.\n- Start concurrent workers together with a barrier, join every worker\nbefore asserting, and require exactly one update.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxGWyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/10QAJIM+Y0A3D0GQjuxLneVaHFA\nbFJv961fgmmR4/b3Upub0dObh676wWGULVHc8ROgW/xtN0VlvNbi2d/p81t45qJv\n6W94Tc/kKzu4SG/VWpc6OyG762nfoCN83tF1hrYM/Wz97m3KCnfQ69fDO4WJocEw\nwcWsmNoRxAYBwkYmyshEY6SunWLmZrEpkRN4qjV9kTpv//ZvNaBZZ8zLg44XMWo/\nv0lV0CUg+yt20kkUm2LxnzF7pJp7RTVGrEsN6VSjEWMe18gyncs3ApDHvuGzDhnN\nJF+1RdWK2Dm5JBZ1rA6NK3LQmnq4PS7gotwKYZpJ6YkdmhbveR1eqDQVMQ/oB/Ze\nrEytL2LWsdAT26pNJhidCT8mUrsIstBz2NhgqiEIzdomvSkfN3PIDh2T1uxIo4a4\n4HZ5Js87xCay8sZbh/99cg/LgJ5xLp/MK4OrbTbdOA+GiQJus6nhCPkRv8AB3Yqw\nObAudVh8B3/DdWtbIneuIBEMzCjeDzpSxunUGM2I5xGUDR31hCO411URaAyTRHM7\ncz0roFk38aaaThXNYxqzpeQMkZiozEyRL9sK0qu+pZEmZoz7QEiXPVrPZg0NIm5h\n4/pgZ1BhbYU0Bo6w3BQeZIq43C7fJEXgW9CgWdKulzeaviYBc7Znl