https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/56a41ba007258b385b986dbbc46efd4c89ec5d96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:00:16Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:00:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add bounded checksum-verifying downloads (#14374)\n\n### Summary\n\nCloses TURBO-6199.\n\nAdd a shared bounded transport library for setup metadata and artifacts.\nPlatform selection remains in the existing adapters, and this PR adds no\nextraction, installation, or CLI wiring.\n\n```text\nApproved origin + byte/time limits\n  read_metadata → Unverified bytes\n  download_verified + trusted SHA-256 → VerifiedArtifact\n```\n\n- Require exact approved origins and reject URL credentials before HTTP.\n- Disable redirects, retries, and automatic decoding, even on an\ninjected HTTP builder.\n- Enforce streaming byte limits and a total request/body/verification\ndeadline.\n- Keep URLs, response bodies, and underlying HTTP errors out of\ndiagnostics.\n- Cover verification, streaming completion, size limits, timeouts, and\nredirects with local fixtures.\n\nDigest provenance remains the caller''s responsibility. Proxy/custom-CA\nproduct integration stays in TURBO-6279; no platform-support claim is\nadded here.","tree":{"sha":"85c16b9b02ba7917df5b78ddc7d467282b25aa7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/85c16b9b02ba7917df5b78ddc7d467282b25aa7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/56a41ba007258b385b986dbbc46efd4c89ec5d96","verification":{"payload":"tree 85c16b9b02ba7917df5b78ddc7d467282b25aa7c\nparent 0a9ac4be338dba1a3b93793f2ae94570989343c5\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791216016 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791216016 -0600\n\nfeat: Add bounded checksum-verifying downloads (#14374)\n\n### Summary\n\nCloses TURBO-6199.\n\nAdd a shared bounded transport library for setup metadata and artifacts.\nPlatform selection remains in the existing adapters, and this PR adds no\nextraction, installation, or CLI wiring.\n\n```text\nApproved origin + byte/time limits\n  read_metadata → Unverified bytes\n  download_verified + trusted SHA-256 → VerifiedArtifact\n```\n\n- Require exact approved origins and reject URL credentials before HTTP.\n- Disable redirects, retries, and automatic decoding, even on an\ninjected HTTP builder.\n- Enforce streaming byte limits and a total request/body/verification\ndeadline.\n- Keep URLs, response bodies, and underlying HTTP errors out of\ndiagnostics.\n- Cover verification, streaming completion, size limits, timeouts, and\nredirects with local fixtures.\n\nDigest provenance remains the caller''s responsibility. Proxy/custom-CA\nproduct integration stays in TURBO-6279; no platform-support claim is\nadded here.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw8mQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnFcQAHrnRoVA9wvMlseoL39Fnsrw\nhljKn2H8zdr