passed,\nincluding 60 filter combinations. Formatting and pre-push checks passed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Shew <anthonyshew@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b159d7c9c75a09b0da1d83322ed914ce9692cf66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/b159d7c9c75a09b0da1d83322ed914ce9692cf66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/0a9ac4be338dba1a3b93793f2ae94570989343c5","verification":{"payload":"tree b159d7c9c75a09b0da1d83322ed914ce9692cf66\nparent 56ab9d65df523dfca4aaa547797ca90ae8bd00e8\nauthor Mohammed Sahil Khan <94916289+sahyl@users.noreply.github.com> 1791215164 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791215164 +0000\n\nfix: Populate task graphs for affected and filtered listings (#14366)\n\nFixes #14359.\n\n`turbo ls --affected` returned no packages when\n`affectedUsingTaskInputs` was enabled because its task graph was empty.\nTag filters had the same underlying problem.\n\nThis loads the task graph when affected detection or filtering needs it\nand adds regression coverage.\n\nTesting: All 14 listing tests and 30 affected-package tests passed,\nincluding 60 filter combinations. Formatting and pre-push checks passed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Shew <anthonyshew@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw8Y8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMQwQADpYA4sfqL7X8BzaQLMcSrVO\nalxXyobd6bQ1CFehdON0JQiLp8FRU6mHuUqutw3Hmx0Oo/pbXv4UX49vNCdf8bFy\nhhdxzZGknmUWR31nm2zBYmUBSvUNdGkIP0Ls/yROkkTV6mW3uxLt5DSzoXwhjaEP\n3BvCTYFLy27kwc0WhYRIwERYZPPWbuURwr5psEF/YwUlui3khekM+sZqyMtOuJpD\nJv9Z0PDflCXyzMy3r065ICicVYxYMm/J/zbVgQf0+sNjH0LOTdZZwVqyDuM7ncj+\nXbkwlOoCL8w25r9MVrgha7JLVA51+1OZVfXtSUPZq5OmATQntqoBs1J7XaiBs4/n\n7yIFTUsZ7a9rBDzrS9eMtofaLZCmNkzPZlKOZMw2zG0tBlPwwZ9unF/AOGUUligY\nX68/i0ime0x2tRGW5dlFj86ctmQPzGoQVuHoKNKbZ8XnPwKNemYIRWpd9DOql4R0\nNPC8gSCvvrwtP0ETTx7ZdEFBdeyWQshSyqB6LpsKDNbXbv3RmrR7ay3F9BOvhH3j\nmoPBJ6/E0QJ1Bqb/LwgjMtZuwF9VMyxUsMVNG1EwrQ7pJKLCqMsJKOaeTneZWEdL\n69sCxcGtCudVHE4bOK74kYo0g79hLnNLAHU