":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/56ab9d65df523dfca4aaa547797ca90ae8bd00e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:34:01Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:34:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add shared platform primitives for setup and shim (#14363)\n\n## Summary\n\nIntroduce a dependency-free `turborepo-platform` primitive shared by the\nCLI shim and setup.\n\n```text\nturborepo-platform (OS + architecture; cfg-backed current target)\n├── turborepo-shim          Existing npm package spellings\n└── turborepo-setup::node   Node artifact names, formats, and URLs\n```\n\n- Share compile-target selection through `Platform::current()` while\nallowing explicit platform values for other targets.\n- Preserve existing shim package names, scoped paths, unknown-target\nfallbacks, and constant function signatures.\n- Keep vendor naming and artifact policy in their respective consumers.\n- Remove the setup-local platform types and string-alias normalization\nAPI.\n- Reject unknown Node targets and filenames longer than 255 bytes\nwithout truncation.\n\nThis foundation changes no local CLI handoff policy and adds no\ndownloads, extraction, or tool installation. Native platform\nqualification remains separate.\n\nCloses TURBO-6296.","tree":{"sha":"df81f53f46b3067b9d263bad5ded2ba72f299032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/df81f53f46b3067b9d263bad5ded2ba72f299032"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/56ab9d65df523dfca4aaa547797ca90ae8bd00e8","verification":{"payload":"tree df81f53f46b3067b9d263bad5ded2ba72f299032\nparent 129acf0dd5b83a21344d8ee383e426e05070cbb5\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791203641 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791203641 -0600\n\nfeat: Add shared platform primitives for setup and shim (#14363)\n\n## Summary\n\nIntroduce a dependency-free `turborepo-platform` primitive shared by the\nCLI shim and setup.\n\n```text\nturborepo-platform (OS + architecture; cfg-backed current target)\n├── turborepo-shim          Existing npm package spellings\n└── turborepo-setup::node   Node artifact names, formats, and URLs\n```\n\n- Share compile-target selection through `Platform::current()` while\nallowing explicit platform values for other targets.\n- Preserve existing shim package names, scoped paths, unknown-target\nfallbacks, and constant function signatures.\n- Keep vendor naming and artifact policy in their respective consumers.\n- Remove the setup-local platform types and string-alias normalization\nAPI.\n- Reject unknown Node targets and filenames longer than 255 bytes\nwithout truncation.\n\nThis foundation changes no local CLI handoff policy and adds no\ndownloads, extraction, or tool installation. Native platform\nqualification remains separate.\n\nCloses TURBO-6296.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw5k5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZT0QACjgmYAhZY1WVMIzAAVOGOiD\nUzxqcFTKH+MxekmhAI7UYn9WEUPXWZB38YmNYm+3GGf749UCRMMvCxJ4jOyeBbKe\n6hAMTCzP3ejrRQu1Xn+2WbzlSPepUApBprx8COJnlspBRSNbO+KH5md2duhojROP\nPzfoBTedSaHorr+29ihB1+T+/U/QPgKI7689PquzO4cHmBfsjURcHM1BLaULagmE\nFsqdpQy3/BiR/lFYGuQ264niMoRHspq4Ub0P8/O