untered an unrelated Factory image/Rust\ntoolchain version mismatch and dependency/type errors elsewhere in the\napp. These remain outside this UI-only change.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebb11cffcb2e411ef34115d3aaef18e7f82beae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/ebb11cffcb2e411ef34115d3aaef18e7f82beae2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/129acf0dd5b83a21344d8ee383e426e05070cbb5","verification":{"payload":"tree ebb11cffcb2e411ef34115d3aaef18e7f82beae2\nparent e3f74b7e6c68f737a0890a1ae88ba81b02538d4d\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791161491 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791161491 +0000\n\nchore: Remove Factory UI clutter (#14371)\n\n## Changes\n- Remove the introductory paragraph, redundant heading, on-demand badge,\nand workspace metadata above the Start work form.\n- Simplify the layout so the form sits directly below the page title,\nkeeping scheduled jobs below it.\n- Add a regression test that prevents introductory clutter from\nreturning.\n\n## Existing blockers\nBroader verification encountered an unrelated Factory image/Rust\ntoolchain version mismatch and dependency/type errors elsewhere in the\napp. These remain outside this UI-only change.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwvSTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3yoQAIvvR/C3sKTOWPHdsFKBihHo\nrMRQPn2+ifj7+fEjP03/uhxBGvDQexBthAinFFKnRQuEWQkIvBF/qpAsrCxyZGvN\nYpt3HktUkfIvxDXBvFdX7h7XP6QUBPYyurlCbwimrNPMW9YhlJNvuunfdFgVkiNW\nmRJM2XvafRJgIhP8Roj9NpJIKLRSjI0+ruL3zOn7GJHyBohrAyQpd3fY04NZ8+PN\nQdpUm5Glbu0LNiRV6+KSiRJwjfxRCnAR1xs36q+PGTEr4sFAaRmdD86DCYBoA5eX\nz3lImf0s7L/4pw8IQ6G3J8wzMaqdO+TyNqzgT7wow9iwsi6/NItZ9eTX2gDkhcmj\nr1W7BgC9VVXDK/NyKI4JTxbB3EHU4