pdate\ninstructions and regression coverage accordingly.\n\n## Main compatibility\nApplied the changes cleanly on the latest fetched `main`,\n`e65143b318a99184091fc86083270ad7be250d3f`, including the new Linear\nintegration. No merge conflicts or unmerged files.\n\n## Remaining issue\nThe existing Factory image Rust pin mismatch is unchanged: the image\nexpects `nightly-2026-05-22`, while `rust-toolchain.toml` requires\n`nightly-2026-07-03`. Fixing that unrelated drift is outside this\nremoval.\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1dc75fde45fd769a5e7eb6a2bbdc8bd849e3b67f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/1dc75fde45fd769a5e7eb6a2bbdc8bd849e3b67f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/e3f74b7e6c68f737a0890a1ae88ba81b02538d4d","verification":{"payload":"tree 1dc75fde45fd769a5e7eb6a2bbdc8bd849e3b67f\nparent e65143b318a99184091fc86083270ad7be250d3f\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791159144 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791159144 +0000\n\nchore: Remove HarnessAgent from Factory (#14370)\n\n## Summary\n- Let Factory inspect the checkout, edit files, and run validation\ndirectly through Eve''s sandbox shell and file tools instead of\ndelegating to a separate coding runtime.\n- Remove HarnessAgent adapters, resume-state plumbing, bridge asset\nstaging, dependencies, and the coding-agent picker; regenerate the\nlockfile with pnpm.\n- Preserve resumable Eve workspaces and legacy workspace records, model\nselection, and thinking-effort controls across follow-up turns. Update\ninstructions and regression coverage accordingly.\n\n## Main compatibility\nApplied the changes cleanly on the latest fetched `main`,\n`e65143b318a99184091fc86083270ad7be250d3f`, including the new Linear\nintegration. No merge conflicts or unmerged files.\n\n## Remaining issue\nThe existing Factory imag