e":"2026-10-05T00:03:43Z","email":"282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:03:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: Add Linear connector to Factory (#14369)\n\n## Changes\n- Add an Eve Linear channel for delegated Agent Sessions and native\nAgent Activity responses at `/eve/v1/linear`.\n- Add a Linear MCP connection for issue, project, cycle, and comment\ntools, with first-use approval per session.\n- Resolve Connect-managed credentials lazily, fail webhook verification\nclosed, and sanitize credential errors.\n- Add focused coverage for credential resolution, verification, and\napp-scoped MCP auth.\n\n## Deployment setup\nProvision and attach both connectors to the Factory Vercel project,\ninstall the Linear agent app, and configure `LINEAR_CONNECT_UID` for the\nagent connector and `LINEAR_MCP_CONNECT_UID` for the app-scoped\n`mcp.linear.app` connector. Forward agent events to `/eve/v1/linear`.\n\n## Remaining limitations\nLive Linear verification is pending connector provisioning.\nRepository-wide validation remains blocked by existing missing\nharness/UI dependencies, sandbox API type mismatches, and a Factory\nimage Rust pin that disagrees with the repository toolchain.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a05953c7cb08b7a5e97cd426d58a92fb4051b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/4a05953c7cb08b7a5e97cd426d58a92fb4051b9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/e65143b318a99184091fc86083270ad7be250d3f","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a05953c7cb08b7a5e97cd426d58a92fb4051b9c\nparent 2f3da8285295c260db1cf4794901b505a588b002\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791158623 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791158623 +0000\n\nchore: Add Linear connector to Factory (#14369)\n\n## Changes\n- Add an Eve Linear channel for delegated Agent Sessions and native\nAgent Activity responses at `/eve/v1/linear`.\n- Add a Linear MCP connection for issue, project, cycle, and comment\ntools, with first-use approval per session.\n- Resolve Connect-managed credentials lazily, fail webhook verification\nclosed, and sanitize credential errors.\n- Add focused coverage for credential resolution, verification, and\napp-scoped MCP auth.\n\n## Deployment setup\nProvision and attach both connectors to the Factory Vercel project,\ninstall the Linear agent app, and configure `LINEAR_CONNECT_UID` for the\nagent connector and `LINEAR_MCP_CONNECT_UID` for the app-scoped\n`mcp.linear.app` connector. Forward agent events to `/eve/v1/linear`.\n\n## Remaining limitations\nLive Linear verification is pending connector provisioning.\nRepository-wide validation remains blocked by existing missing\nharness/UI dependencies, sandbox API type mismatches, and a Factory\nimage Rust pin that disagrees with the repository toolchain.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwulfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhb8QACdBEc1cYhF1dLvTdMQaaGAn\ny7VXX0O5XJAV3aE/JDw26nUi/FDjzPZjtfH82aZEFJVvPMAv1C/uJR5SAsoPE/uu\njxBHAtF7IeW71ZVkUOyMHlJUzN1pNHBuvNxrpJMsS1lN4VTw3e4G8++QxbUciuUR\nT+1De8gy19DRxbCzBwseJ8DJIf/23lYhMwmqHSOYmEoRP2TErfN76dM2skB70QNV\nZ3CiWBEYUifHpTKiSx8b5NJ0fZcPOMM+/jcwHGJDcWhm4BXRhrVAdXRi2HyBNQzm\nA6SnxM6Cpdqh6gKj23ipyPLHKNjC0BAGH9nyLQZSPzWUlU8Ghn9RJ+Wj5q57PQKO\nQz+yCJQwswy7u9zpq3TtjLYDsdMUBwFMtzDsi9oh5JOATRnxSRWKW6z617kgqstK\n7VcUy+mjwuaKnOvt/ysNXJ/qj6P0vVwXlZJJGwHS77fO0M1ghn21aVbsJUCfC3LZ\nZH8E+FM/yZGIJi+CPWKGHog+fcEXSS4OITU5ZL58yNzNKQ+EaRlzEzRfYOrdZ3Mw\nIgN5QOLCkBg4wDeOHC+c67WQq/wiYyC4dontVsn2npbzTnfUnkDucgjFQlhM/TOw\nNL3rWgoYZ17973aSXM2vPv8obDo5Ug9XTh8kJ47tWgucNSQK5wAPaIx2UhZjUXES\nBj2RliXMpKRl/Q2w8GRJ\n=