pi.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel-gh-bot-3","id":282332853,"login":"vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOENQOtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/66dbdb377cae04107ef03e155ad1bd55c5a479ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:46:29Z","email":"282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:46:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Use repository package manager for automatic Turbo downloads (#14360)\n\n## Summary\nFixes #14358.\n\nInfer the repository''s package manager from package metadata or, when\nunavailable, its lockfile, and use its package runner for automatic\nlocal Turbo downloads instead of always invoking npx. Preserve the\npinned Turbo version, argument forwarding, repository working directory,\ninvocation-directory environment, and version-gated recursion\nprotection. Retain npx for npm and Yarn Classic, which has no dlx\ncommand.\n\nAdd regression coverage for Bun packageManager and strict devEngines\ndeclarations, lockfile-only inference, supported runners, and modern and\nlegacy Turbo command configuration. Only\ncrates/turborepo-shim/src/run.rs changes; no lockfiles or unrelated\nfiles are modified.\n\n## Manual verification\nInstalled Bun 1.4.2 in a temporary directory and verified that bun x and\nbunx both run Turbo 2.11.5 and produce the expected build dry-run\noutput. In a temporary workspace with strict Bun devEngines and no local\nTurbo installation, npx reproduced EBADDEVENGINES, while the rebuilt\npatched launcher automatically downloaded and ran the pinned Turbo\n2.11.5. A real build succeeded and printed the forwarded task argument,\nconfirming argument forwarding end to end.\n\nNo known remaining blockers.\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d678c07dadf40d07a3661c52e03dd3a8bcb3bef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/9d678c07dadf40d07a3661c52e03dd3a8bcb3bef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/66dbdb377cae04107ef03e155ad1bd55c5a479ac","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d678c07dadf40d07a3661c52e03dd3a8bcb3bef\nparent 13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791081989 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791081989 +0000\n\nfix: Use repository package manager for automatic Turbo downloads (#14360)\n\n## Summary\nFixes #14358.\n\nInfer the repository''s package manager from package metadata or, when\nunavailable, its lockfile, and use its package runner for automatic\nlocal Turbo downloads instead of always invoking npx. Preserve the\npinned Turbo version, argument forwarding, repository working directory,\ninvocation-directory environment, and version-gated recursion\nprotection. Retain npx for npm and Yarn Classic, which has no dlx\ncommand.\n\nAdd regression coverage for Bun packageManager and strict devEngines\ndeclarations, lockfile-only inference, supported runners, and modern and\nlegacy Turbo command configuration. Only\ncrates/turborepo-shim/src/run.rs changes; no lockfiles or unrelated\nfiles are modified.\n\n## Manual verification\nInstalled Bun 1.4.2 in a temporary directory and verified that bun x and\nbunx both run Turbo 2.11.5 and produce the expected build dry-run\noutput. In a temporary workspace with strict Bun devEngines and no local\nTurbo installation, npx reproduced EBADDEVENGINES, while the rebuilt\npatched launcher automatically downloaded and ran the pinned Turbo\n2.11.5. A real build succeeded and printed the forwarded task argument,\nconfirming argument forwarding end to end.\n\nNo known remaining blockers.\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwb4FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/ywQAFrcd1t+Q7l1feen3uUSZRs2\nAch490fm9Y13MlGx4wo2m7iG+0x6g9KEItE6aVdfVx2+Y0tEgmiURGL+S25sjVIu\nSHzwTb7zzZQ1SMWLb2Dyr4OzVwnQsnoIlrRvVhpMqDfeNLCLUpe3bDWuw/7Xev86\nXnPCKgd6pA0ok5IZohZy0kdB6sUUqodZCszyKJMYtI0xP8xOYP2FCBfwhytXVNDS\nO1zc3KNTsTOPgf+vG8dU/r1SmrJeEJZh0rTDjKd1vX7CjIhrnfVyo6DurMqJRd4S\nmkPdpn/MaFKXN4JuuG9V0L35k6lIgsDaEckyqD0ijzCat/htrE7hHuqlsNcIXOeU\nxzgvqXBLMamL++Do7/3VXyk2CfOl7QB4emB8sE5bfKnWmdA2Jwd5ahUVFn/QT0Tz\nQ5gdLBUgvYMMxNRmO5qCTL41Jzcz74g+rIV4ix5Mm8Q4D/sZmz8J1Re1Pt/aS4zI\nuKJeUEwrihB6u3hM2NoM9dqmwGqAp7GbTYTvv38hUWsH9cH4GQmo6pstUu58+xgn\ngJh9p+C+ZjON376K522U5rfU471Ck0fqsk/rP+3O2wLc9yx7XrkjRezGtKmCNr8d\ngMUAaFsbyV4fsy70ASyB2m6zIZ0rj7cTybSBRkB8KPkjoQuRgH9c48pD77ISOwkd\nTiFfsj8hrRS5YqKgcYQx\n=WG2M\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T02:46:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/66dbdb377cae04107ef03e155ad1bd55c5a479ac","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKDY2ZGJkYjM3N2NhZTA0MTA3ZWYwM2UxNTVhZDFiZDU1YzVhNDc5YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d","sha":"13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d"}],"sha":"66dbdb377cae04107ef03e155ad1bd55c5a479ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/66dbdb377cae04107ef03e155ad1bd55c5a479ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3623469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel-gh-bot-3","id":282332853,"login":"vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOENQOtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-3%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:45:44Z","email":"282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:45:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Remove Bash dependency from strict environment tests (#14362)\n\n## Summary\nThe strict-environment usage fixture previously launched PATH-resolved\nBash twice: npm''s `script-shell=bash` override, followed by `bash\nbuild.sh`. On Windows, that can resolve to the WSL launcher rather than\nGit Bash, introducing an unnecessary shell dependency into an\nenvironment-filtering test.\n\n- Replace the Bash fixture with a Node script that preserves its output\nformat.\n- Use npm''s native script shell for this fixture without changing shared\ntest setup.\n- Add a regression that shadows Bash with a fail-fast executable in both\nstrict and loose modes.\n- Strengthen assertions for declared dependency variables and refresh\nthe affected task-hash snapshot.\n\n## Manual verification and limitations\nConfirmed the new regression fails when restoring only the old\n`script-shell=bash` override, and passes with the fix. This verifies\nthat changing the task script alone would not remove the Bash\ndependency.\n\nWindows execution was unavailable. This removes a concrete Windows\nshell-resolution hazard, but the reported five-minute hang and its\nprecise root cause have not been reproduced on Windows. Confirmation on\na Windows runner remains.\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"841fe5fc2480c13b3655ce29359bd9a710db12fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/841fe5fc2480c13b3655ce29359bd9a710db12fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d","verification":{"payload":"tree 841fe5fc2480c13b3655ce29359bd9a710db12fd\nparent c0b746e6ffc78b0e71bc8ef6b7125d397dc540ae\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791081944 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791081944 -0600\n\nfix: Remove Bash dependency from strict environment tests (#14362)\n\n## Summary\nThe strict-environment usage fixture previously launched PATH-resolved\nBash twice: npm''s `script-shell=bash` override, followed by `bash\nbuild.sh`. On Windows, that can resolve to the WSL launcher rather than\nGit Bash, introducing an unnecessary shell dependency into an\nenvironment-filtering test.\n\n- Replace the Bash fixture with a Node script that preserves its output\nformat.\n- Use npm''s native script shell for this fixture without changing shared\ntest setup.\n- Add a regression that shadows Bash with a fail-fast executable in both\nstrict and loose modes.\n- Strengthen assertions for declared dependency variables and refresh\nthe affected task-hash snapshot.\n\n## Manual verification and limitations\nConfirmed the new regression fails when restoring only the old\n`script-shell=bash` override, and passes with the fix. This verifies\nthat changing the task script alone would not remove the Bash\ndependency.\n\nWindows execution was unavailable. This removes a concrete Windows\nshell-resolution hazard, but the reported five-minute hang and its\nprecise root cause have not been reproduced on Windows. Confirmation on\na Windows runner remains.\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwb3YCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUR8QAKNe+xjo7iIPPHHE0nLeNA1L\ndbcVnaBjh/++N5RKV6RYh9AJmVIBTWTQbQ7StAOHg+girK5JbpeSQeXmRRdhOpiy\nnZ8qDYMdYB+rsnBXTEJD15QN4vf3o2014KltgbGKxWxIrMwuR5X31EubXZ86Z45Z\n7rN4ypWEr+lNa+t748uMC18dsj98WwvGmJ93dAwg5SaDlNNG7Gzdwg+1Z14uFDSA\n1I+VT3UfP49NnSeR2siOWdmsEo0Uxtg+yl2Tje/VN+i/pLhSAUIlA+UARmGqZMIn\nzkjNLCCboezNGedUMuzDQy2Bx14K1b3CnWBICm/tbcmw9W6UO3Te8v+b+SB9ik9c\nfcfSL5Jfrlp9SjNLxCprPj1Q4HdBYNBKEs3Np7umiCAYQ0UZID8qn1hCjc5Bnc3Q\nATwneApa21KopO/0zrPIv/Hi8LUaQlJASTDa+sAUHPYaBIs/M8Nx1p/2wMPDQwDT\nAjUUkTPvJc5lHhpQvCyb6kcEqLUw9ES7IRRHwYVlCNx3kkr532p35JwgPSXR8R50\nUYuPKi/cvF9DoylDpf22DlGWHoLbPGbQI1N3X9gr/F9PHZgP1LOlemO5D994bsKh\nBgcDZ9fPK/FzB4TJOi76p9iKduJej/WLVl4cMwV+8cCI/Q9gVTdzyxAZg6HiAA5u\nKoB2EI3TBQDlRcpjQRBX\n=Z/+P\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T02:45:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKDEzZjYyNGM4NzUwZWMwOWYwMmVkMmE0ZTk5Y2RmOTI1ODNjODFiMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/c0b746e6ffc78b0e71bc8ef6b7125d397dc540ae","sha":"c0b746e6ffc78b0e71bc8ef6b7125d397dc540ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/c0b746e6ffc78b0e71bc8ef6b7125d397dc540ae"}],"sha":"13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/13f624c8750ec09f02ed2a4e99cdf92583c81b0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/c0b746e6ffc78b0e71bc8ef6b7125d397dc540ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:31:00Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:31:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add experimental setup future flag (#14361)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdd the root-only `futureFlags.experimentalSetup` opt-in as a foundation\nfor managed repository setup.\n\n```diff\n \"futureFlags\": {\n+  \"experimentalSetup\": true\n }\n```\n\n- Default the flag to `false` and preserve strict boolean and\nunknown-key validation.\n- Keep the Rust parser, manual TypeScript forms, generated schemas, and\npublic types aligned.\n- Document the experimental status and unstable prelaunch `turbo.lock`\nformat.\n- Preserve existing run and task-hash behavior with the flag omitted,\ndisabled, or enabled, including when `turbo.lock` is present.\n\nThis is a parser/type foundation only: it adds no setup command, `setup`\nconfiguration key, or lock processing. Follow-up PRs must gate each\nsetup, execution, activation, and hashing surface behind this flag.\n\nCloses TURBO-6295.\nPart of TURBO-6275.","tree":{"sha":"85c67902b4f2ae4539196a1ef396f9285fb01365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/85c67902b4f2ae4539196a1ef396f9285fb01365"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/c0b746e6ffc78b0e71bc8ef6b7125d397dc540ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 85c67902b4f2ae4539196a1ef396f9285fb01365\nparent 811382df30fbb2494726f872c5a98b806e32220d\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1791066660 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791066660 -0600\n\nfeat: Add experimental setup future flag (#14361)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdd the root-only `futureFlags.experimentalSetup` opt-in as a foundation\nfor managed repository setup.\n\n```diff\n \"futureFlags\": {\n+  \"experimentalSetup\": true\n }\n```\n\n- Default the flag to `false` and preserve strict boolean and\nunknown-key validation.\n- Keep the Rust parser, manual TypeScript forms, generated schemas, and\npublic types aligned.\n- Document the experimental status and unstable prelaunch `turbo.lock`\nformat.\n- Preserve existing run and task-hash behavior with the flag omitted,\ndisabled, or enabled, including when `turbo.lock` is present.\n\nThis is a parser/type foundation only: it adds no setup command, `setup`\nconfiguration key, or lock processing. Follow-up PRs must gate each\nsetup, execution, activation, and hashing surface behind this flag.\n\nCloses TURBO-6295.\nPart of TURBO-6275.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwYIkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASWIQAE4c95RlT28JBHeQJJKsP361\nb/KK8Lce66QIX7cBlCSfXP1UDiHJ6bLQsre8R2kYV+538RR7Nv0gkJb0LIpiiT1U\ntMilLt1NdpmEc/oJo8CzRZasT5Dijvt2x9DZ3J5FBCph1053HDqRlK7tzx68hNj4\nWmOMiNVjGVsLXtVdzroXua2a3P+poW9u6xyCeHR7jjUAjlQ1sMsHBWyfPSYFaRtn\nGaD6zeXYForMwEjwT0s14lUTFApPCVRjXBGECjvYzvPtfsrQUXHusPn43W5taorB\nV4DbLmgaBs3wifa4tVdfLwuwsdTGtEtdNaiH5OyzVQXtmncSrBR4maQ3q/udKqa+\nSXVR5RxyhlAuGhuVA61P4DsgQmRSWYX2uJn8+9NwcrDpgs2WVfWACZ+JUyAfFp+Z\nhAO4XC0+hRVsmYV7gTj9KxZ/Q81XWc493nE1DJ19kA0odAywVTcNruEVMpSEPk1P\nQYI9bizGDn08wePp9QtMe8y+nGuRgBZT5l56fsPGP1Muw2s2BvN3N1itfzmCee1N\n0LgEgyVMcHmgWez4ueRBMl83mjeZVGqbypySh6/rpNRRKOanCqOItmh9+96lk93a\nSGxFTsJPA+/at4y0gBW//AtsEuh4FzFp7cJWa4XerLhCHTcQqdujfFt+Fxlpid+S\nqDyL1KW7pGwD5RFt6zw2\n=SKD3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T22:31:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/c0b746e6ffc78b0e71bc8ef6b7125d397dc540ae","node_id":"