: Update with-vitest example (#14355)\n\n## Summary\n\n- update `with-vitest` to the latest exact pnpm, Node.js, Turborepo,\nTypeScript, Vitest, Next.js, React, and supporting package versions\n- migrate linting from the TypeScript-API-dependent ESLint setup to\nBiome so the example supports TypeScript 7 without retaining deprecated\nor incompatible configuration\n- adopt pnpm 12''s `allowBuilds` configuration for reviewed dependency\nlifecycle scripts and keep a local pnpm executable available to Turbo\ntask execution\n- update the Vitest root package to ESM and modernize the UI sources for\nthe current lint rules\n- regenerate the pnpm lockfile\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"69b22b998e58a4926828e5f0421827b0fa06acd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/69b22b998e58a4926828e5f0421827b0fa06acd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/811382df30fbb2494726f872c5a98b806e32220d","verification":{"payload":"tree 69b22b998e58a4926828e5f0421827b0fa06acd9\nparent 2540ee1d740bb96bf249459a7957ef4b380c9e43\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-3[bot] <282332853+vercel-gh-bot-3[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790967394 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790967394 +0000\n\nchore: Update with-vitest example (#14355)\n\n## Summary\n\n- update `with-vitest` to the latest exact pnpm, Node.js, Turborepo,\nTypeScript, Vitest, Next.js, React, and supporting package versions\n- migrate linting from the TypeScript-API-dependent ESLint setup to\nBiome so the example supports TypeScript 7 without retaining deprecated\nor incompatible configuration\n- adopt pnpm 12''s `allowBuilds` configuration for reviewed dependency\nlifecycle scripts and keep a local pnpm executable available to Turbo\ntask execution\n- update the Vitest root package to ESM and modernize the UI sources for\nthe current lint rules\n- regenerate the pnpm lockfile\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bo