el/turborepo/commits/3ce82f57d27f37877f09fc1200c2fda64b9f3596"}],"sha":"2540ee1d740bb96bf249459a7957ef4b380c9e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/2540ee1d740bb96bf249459a7957ef4b380c9e43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/3ce82f57d27f37877f09fc1200c2fda64b9f3596/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:31:29Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:31:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Ignore Vercel OIDC token rotation in .env.local cache inputs (#14356)\n\n## Summary\n\nVercel writes a frequently rotating `VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN` into each\nproject''s `.env.local`. When that file is a task input or global\ndependency, token rotation causes unnecessary cache misses.\n\nNormalize the token value only in the in-memory representation used for\ncache hashing:\n\n```diff\n .env.local cache input\n-VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN=rotating-token\n+VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN=__TURBOREPO_VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN__\n OTHER_VARIABLE=unchanged\n```\n\n- Leave files on disk untouched and preserve hashing of all other\ncontent, including token assignment addition or removal.\n- Apply consistently across task/global file inputs and Git/manual\nhashing, bypassing raw Git blob reuse for matching files.\n- Keep Git verification and explicit process-environment hashing\nunchanged.\n- Fall back to ordinary hashing for ambiguous or unsupported syntax,\nduplicate token assignments, and files larger than 1 MiB.\n\nNo new configuration or documentation changes.","tree":{"sha":"12e33aadd5a65bbf10627875979e7c93baedfd38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/12e33aadd5a65bbf10627875979e7c93baedfd38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/3ce82f57d27f37877f09fc1200c2fda64b9f3596","verification":{"payload":"tree 12e33aadd5a65bbf10627875979e7c93baedfd38\nparent 8cc3cce30705a88ac9020d1adc2bf06f391fdf2d\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790951489 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790951489 -0600\n\nfix: Ignore Vercel OIDC token rotation in .env.local cache inputs (#14356)\n\n## Summary\n\nVercel writes a frequently rotating `VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN` into each\nproject''s `.env.local`. When that file is a task input or global\ndependency, token rotation causes unnecessary cache misses.\n\nNormalize the token value only in the in-memory representation used for\ncache hashing:\n\n```diff\n .env.local cache input\n-VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN=rotating-token\n+VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN=__TURBOREPO_VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN__\n OTHER_VARIABLE=unchanged\n```\n\n- Leave files on disk untouched and preserve hashing of all other\ncontent, including token assignment addition or removal.\n- Apply consistently across task/global file inputs and Git/manual\nhashing, bypassing raw Git blob reuse for matching files.\n- Keep Git verification and explicit process-environment hashing\nunchanged.\n- Fall back to ordinary hashing for ambiguous or unsupported syntax,\nduplicate token assignments, and files larger than 1 MiB.\n\nNo new configuration or documentation changes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv8BBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWxkQAKfpR9SIOD6DR3nI51bEGCzf\nVP97yiBR42u+xGWMtw+u2w2yC/nQpgROBd8kZ3qUPuRRX5ZqUTFqpzkOgQbASWl4\nsUrnPDePuvPENH+tz4hy72Lm2eHwNDz/iXNl8HUM+Tp2xNr6A1gzqAsuAuEwT10W\nCRcuansEDV2eUSh3bku6cVHBO6AJtCXZooUgOMzz07SAOLaOaFDHb7H2MSX+rsYk\njUuqk7BXPIOwNan2fL7Wdw8Imf7X0s1qRM/+0odDrff13KcIKLRJz37PKgDiU4c8\nkWCoe7EcyCf+ZX6nk238UG/Ekba7g9iNN4ZxqYjf2va/QdY+6hSjr1eF6KoWfPcA\nfcK1A6L2XeosiaEC4gOAo4N53Kng6eh/PF0kOJuwwKNV7e8A9iHyp6X4THeQYDLT\nVRcwss/SKHhbfDv+E4GK20WAdfJAsR4e6qjn25IfsZ9t66RlPLnlcmOywOxSsloM\n6d6gDoPM3GTRt8silgxY8aUAN1lkSDLLMnd9S1gifzABiQRoUB0Y2etPTIEPuHkp\nx60U/Crpxbe7vCTzl4c1Bvxu+IHLaGCSw7P/ivAma9TndcEYP/W+4Ebe9and/Brz\n8hDb0iShszP3kYDZ4rKEzxrKDBMAn9qeJOigKM0odZzlG9tcM1G5DUYsB5ZrApT6\nF7/F8drvPdKpWWc9zmha\n=Cmab\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T14:31:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"ht