ring `--env-mode=loose`.\n\n```diff\n \"globalPassThroughEnv\": [\n   ...\n   \"RUSTC_WRAPPER\",\n+  \"SDKROOT\",\n   \"CARGO_INCREMENTAL\",\n   ...\n ]\n```","tree":{"sha":"976e90bdf0fb970b22262f60de2cc96c4294d744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/976e90bdf0fb970b22262f60de2cc96c4294d744"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/41387de0cdd241314f84c5ee9eef4728197c4fda","verification":{"payload":"tree 976e90bdf0fb970b22262f60de2cc96c4294d744\nparent 3a2072cad9eadc0f21a5eff2a93abbb40ed2b572\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790866704 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790866704 -0600\n\nfix: Pass SDKROOT through to repository tasks (#14353)\n\nAdds `SDKROOT` to the repository’s global passthrough environment\nvariables so native builds can use the configured Apple SDK in strict\nenvironment mode without requiring `--env-mode=loose`.\n\n```diff\n \"globalPassThroughEnv\": [\n   ...\n   \"RUSTC_WRAPPER\",\n+  \"SDKROOT\",\n   \"CARGO_INCREMENTAL\",\n   ...\n ]\n```","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvnUQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVtsQADoXpUUHrfewQPJRRJqflXBS\nI/PbRTZx5s8CUXzDBhaaR0oBF/l6gIbU0pgRHX+fxUFiZ+rdresaS+jQXOO3Aggi\nLm91Ga9atExdP9pQW8t9JlGRegtpJLrpaRC41612WdEaQqW8corsqeBd2/v71jGp\nO4AAxKjJ+y19KQwlRDgFixr3MuYadO5qHJehJgt50gY4H/JTbB1QC4UkZDr0k+Sz\nhEKIBvKu8VzdMPU/3NzmmwCMXwMjJ8CHYBIySDifZUlLXX25oUUKtEJLmQpg0nlg\nhPTDGWYMUBG15g+KXThccpsxEBP+oEgZzpIgmM/C95SntQMqAMhdpiqtTQGn+RbK\npoUhT9hDE6G9a8UqBh1ObqA9ycD8Y4U2AiHCZst6NlKAuko63kuolMiyfmcLIKtJ\neCq1QBmW1ef3IGPwbV9KPjPscHJx64IxfbIzIfiJHg2KTNpZ9c2ECY2vXN0q0nkm\nIxvVknKHem/urwRa6eXv/WaKUay8C+OiHo6pmWfKy1i73RgXHwiqomUAPxvR1oO0\niBka1zouRTlph79fmjT84HAEDikHms07+AaSS+XFlL7q+OKtw9fXX80kKlwa+U4F\nKc2GFW5tyX3ExD3Q6PJ2PSOEgr1u5tfLPq869oaB2JWLyDYB5VrgRFCUck9sS16U\nLGTfb5eNvFJxHsHKGWh9\n=x0vR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T14:58:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://av