334)\n(`ac80140`)\n- fix: Keep Yarn patch resolutions with npm protocol selectors in prune\n(#14337) (`6a10319`)\n- chore: Update with-tailwind example (#14264) (`19e93e3`)\n- ci: Resolve latest turbo release with workflow token (#14339)\n(`a697401`)\n- chore: Update with-ultracite example (#14335) (`03c591a`)\n- fix: Match production MFE negative lookaheads locally (#13496)\n(`3dfd879`)\n- docs: Add missing system environment variables and run flags (#13811)\n(`d7d1065`)\n- fix: Normalize task inputs consistently for affected detection and\nhashing (#14341) (`07ee418`)\n- feat: Add task tags with configuration inheritance (#14342)\n(`d44edbe`)\n- fix: Upgrade brace-expansion to latest compatible releases (#14347)\n(`0deb0e7`)\n- docs: Point security.txt to Vercel HackerOne program (#14346)\n(`fa107aa`)\n- test: Deflake untracked scan-scope assertions (#14348) (`b4570e0`)\n- feat: Expose task and package tags in `query` (#14343) (`fba5351`)\n- feat: Filter `query` tasks and packages by tags (#14344) (`49d1607`)\n- feat: Filter tasks by tags in the CLI (#14345) (`bc7c148`)\n- fix: Complete task `query` metadata for non-script entrypoints\n(#14350) (`a409ce5`)\n- fix: Infer single-package mode for query commands (#14351) (`90718d1`)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvdrMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPOkQAGbitK2Mov/JlBQmKXVxv58v\nzDEDqaBhWLK7U9fq2b5OVKet37+u+8omSRoReOfgpkjLMO+ao+d2Cmnk9v69/3Jz\nVfNRHuJFYUOfshQPEnSGeJHrp7mwp15dnc8yVE6REnkS26QhxfmeW4Np0wqEFqeO\n+sTtoDsm+BzUa+404ru7OO+qKICNB0ejocJJPRm9poAAQsRGvsPuGRrnVQgRXxCJ\nvguUCMm2StOTXeoa2LcFbp/ykxLNod8RcI85w8IlA++r5FuZyb1oAmtWDk/1sjW0\nnDTWuKwx4gF/FnuPCzCqaErtApliNG7SOk5LhDq59OQMwgvx5oO+jwV7JUGuAUee\nouCUeEZVQZSzzMJ8g9k3DeHCrQgkLRYPpcIoRtXDzT/VLKT1yvh/z7ArJLEAlpCd\nW0oKQWUOTacWTOOcRbWyA+AdBHpbafCWH3DEqnDm4Ls36dQxUq9sBkjYjT5WShWG\nCLJ6Jzi+BSkmg5s8U4J/XaZjBuin3PBS32CJ0RmzMoEr+k+gU