rs/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/90718d15c5249ddb037c7461db6ecb51bf0eb2c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:34:59Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:34:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Infer single-package mode for query commands (#14351)\n\n## Summary\n\nSingle-package repository mode was inferred for `run` and `watch`, but\nwas not propagated to `query`. Without an explicit or shim-injected\n`--single-package` flag, queries could miss root-package tasks and\nincorrectly report no affected tasks.\n\n```text\nSingle-package repository inference\n  → Query execution selector\n  → Single-package task graph\n  → Affected task results\n```\n\n- Apply inferred single-package mode to all query commands while\npreserving the explicit flag.\n- Preserve single-package mode when converting `query ls` arguments into\nexecution selectors.\n- Add regression coverage for repository-mode propagation, task\ndiscovery, affected-task results, and `--exit-code`, with and without\ntask-input filtering and the explicit flag.","tree":{"sha":"29ea5c359b04347acf743abf1501f74bcf740241","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/29ea5c359b04347acf743abf1501f74bcf740241"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/90718d15c5249ddb037c7461db6ecb51bf0eb2c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 29ea5c359b04347acf743abf1501f74bcf740241\nparent a409ce5af84a094b669ef0df994d77bfdf63b32a\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790825699 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790825699 -0600\n\nfix: Infer single-package mode for query commands (#14351)\n\n## Summary\n\nSingle-package repository mode was inferred for `run` and `watch`, but\nwas not propagated to `query`. Without an explicit or shim-injected\n`--single-package` flag, queries could miss root-package tasks and\nincorrectly report no affected tasks.\n\n```text\nSingle-package repository inference\n  → Query execution selector\n  → Single-package task graph\n  → Affected task results\n```\n\n- Apply inferred single-package mode to all query commands while\npreserving the explicit flag.\n- Preserve single-package mode when converting `query ls` arguments into\nexecution selectors.\n- Add regression coverage for repository-mode propagation, task\ndiscovery, affected-task results, and `--exit-code`, with and without\ntask-input filtering and the explicit flag.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvdTjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9kEQAJ9skIzUEbejA4VZMcvrmGJ0\nH8AYwxCfDYxiJZ6Dy4Q0BHD7legZH3eZT/q/BI3ni31EaieoyhtwJIuDU2BcTdnh\nOlmvpKR0tkTxTs0NsFQuYMLEr/vPNh1BiwoDA5/EWuOOm53fnjJbTZk8SIbLC76y\n9gWuJxtrjs4gJMdRAnh8lLbI1YI17Ftnh0bMj7TLe5gzpI/opAwcXAuJwL3q6bAm\noRxsl30fDUlS/Di+bBhmAC6adMwJ3ABFEAQU4e+WzMS2cgoWPHEHOoDODf3XaaJ2\nBHSOFc/n9JiT0lKmrSZMHUJYTNcUAF/k/hoF46/n95wIVKHlo1McfD+RUCkQ+ZoS\nEs4M/gTwv/blCw0saGe68akqNiovvdgoNI3scNkMn43XQJEb7CWI1HbkdMuQMf96\nhjYjgFSaRzTQ+EQBVgLAvl4LBPPo+2Y0bgM5oKFPfoORJtu/LQRQTZVjUzIhyX3x\nYHX8RsF6FQlO/lsPQcg2daE03EtLJXfNU2r14uVTOUMnQMZzWWoYatRVZRggd7K5\n5sD2R7O7StAFBGI