cription\n\nCI should consume a query-selected execution graph rather than recreate\ntask configuration and inheritance in its planner.\n\n```text\nConfigured check (ci, no script)\n└── build (runnable prerequisite)\n```","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvX4LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbs8QAGRkdB75iIQT4L6pncq2J3rb\nzDN8YZ+8QgxvX7QCx4qi6s1iMi7jsfDTh1EDwXifwSBKniq2s0zKhlaQWsM3PTct\nV+gEeLXTrIoo4jZL56QSA+pQiuW/+mKL5tzFH4fQ3NMbe6sOwDJlivRV122aYNnq\nTaqyVjRXxHoLUEko1KJblHiDn+gxRenBhM2uuDCreKYaI3WGNRMBR6gVk57ZK2ao\neIX3ypBAjsl+Z/jFNuX7lWMAnFx1RO4J9Mka/7cFHcYaWsWwUpsYV0oIpXlaCuQ1\ng1rbdJi7TqeZezSfDXbA0lYVAGdXVZkqMaLqGph0sMypz87EzYYeSf/otAcO7JQO\nQjhbGwpJJkDVZ/cdhD6XyjXmtd+3PTTFaqMTlImzHf7URjDJLJQ6nSdKLtVg6xtD\nHrTep0+cJ6wifcn200275T9slVyPpnzpzh+jrtrAPZQKRadSNJI+uHx968pyRptG\nJkYM7JKmCzmrHgGaESn6dCbXT3nyXcscjBYrVcAZb/+XWCp2SecSUnIG1ulInf3F\nC/bBc2DGEPLeXn0Y0hgz9LsfqM6niFC7kMzVQrhiSfGhAlnHyW2pciLd2RbW37pM\na5VdwoMItDEyM4rE01MybHFPx2jcU/kse/30qvriOOnb+1+13HrEmWKo29ReK6kB\n0BcDRYTto8WjHhezHX2C\n=swyb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:24:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/a409ce5af84a094b669ef0df994d77bfdf63b32a","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKGE0MDljZTVhZjg0YTA5NGI2NjllZjBkZjk5NGQ3N2JmZGY2M2IzMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/bc7c148ac1c3680d4f3d13b91f265beed87edba1","sha":"bc7c148ac1c3680d4f3d13b91f265beed87edba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/bc7c148ac1c3680d4f3d13b91f265beed87edba1"}],"sha":"a409ce5af84a094b669ef0df994d77bfdf63b32a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/a409ce5af84a094b669ef0df994d77bfdf63b32a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/bc7c148ac1c3680d4f3d13b91f265beed87edba1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:30:06Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:30:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Filter tasks by tags in the CLI (#14345)\n\n### Description\n\nIndependent CLI slice of the generic tags work, based on #14342. It does\nnot depend on either Query PR.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  S[Tag selector] --> M[Match package or task labels]\n  M --> T[Expand selector traversal]\n  T --> D[Retain execution dependencies and with siblings]\n```\n\n- Add --filter=tag:<label> without requiring a future flag, matching\nexact, case-sensitive labels.\n- Support exclusion, dependency/dependent traversal, directory/Git\nqualifiers, and JSON-quoted literal labels.\n- Preserve ordinary package filters and affected-selection behavior when\nmixed with tag filters.\n- Preserve required dependencies and co-scheduled with tasks, including\nsiblings attached to dependencies.\n- Document the selectors and keep package-label access independent of\nboundaries.\n\nTags remain arbitrary labels. This PR assigns no Vercel CI semantics to\nci, !ci, CPU, or OIDC labels.","tree":{"sha":"761eca5ccaa05b89dabba821a55fc0d9b8b226a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/761eca5ccaa05b89dabba821a55fc0d9b8b226a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/bc7c148ac1c3680d4f3d13b91f265beed87edba1","verification":{"payload":"tree 761eca5ccaa05b89dabba821a55fc0d9b8b226a3\nparent 49d16076271dad9b56421d3ff8e702a33f9d5f50\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790782206 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790782206 -0600\n\nfeat: Filter tasks by tags in the CLI (#14345)\n\n### Description\n\nIndependent CLI slice of the generic tags work, based on #14342. It does\nnot depend on either Query PR.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  S[Tag selector] --> M[Match package or task labels]\n  M --> T[Expand selector traversal]\n  T --> D[Retain execution dependencies and with siblings]\n```\n\n- Add --filter=tag:<label> without requiring a future flag, matching\nexact, case-sensitive labels.\n- Support exclusion, dependency/dependent traversal, directory/Git\nqualifiers, and JSON-quoted literal labels.\n- Preserve ordinary package filters and affected-selection behavior when\nmixed with tag filters.\n- Preserve required dependencies and co-scheduled with tasks, including\nsiblings attached to dependencies.\n- Document the selectors and keep package-label access independent of\nboundaries.\n\nTags remain arbitrary labels. This PR assigns no Vercel CI semantics to\nci, !ci, CPU, or OIDC labels.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvSr+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAx0YQAH+Y3/5VPiCInGiueKV3j3QF\nJHYW8R1HHgNh5vERP8wr2nPO14PGdiect1TFprVTDvXiylLIERThVvLj7Nchw0Pb\ngWB3SwyS+/YLqJ/ScHbOYyiACRT1dJbOwecRQwyJrFE3PZRTyjcN9cPfH3LaxdR4\n1DlZzBv9/w9oQkwkndiVCQpc+ag7cadLMJdQzsVm3arpMRBCNFro98vvDQc213GM\nh86AnJcI7URP9LuG43u/SrikCduTIVxPxCH+06G/WN+q+H9vZH8+NImivtEqowtu\n2vvqiIehwP+XcYNNj0bVU0LBqG3Wv7/Fgl01BIEUd0M6cm9+GgpRnqup0i/lo0+a\nlIy9ByHf0gdboWaSTpgrUMAdLHcS3wyLQkB4zg3GOT0EL1wyMyZLOvGBECRc4yi4\nfwRMG2gsF2HbItjUt3fPtwGHFvUTQCCOSsGxwVo+KrOfS5qP3jbKyViuc4+xjsXs\nKNHlDrn4BbqRV+oDD6Cc3Gt2pmkHjXx1tje7FnD1LgZ/ZQbuPsCBAJ5EHeTSkjzb\nX3qIZQ3k5a/hU39qWoisHniWllUTF4TLE0dEvIGtMr+Wfk83byLEoOZynAsbbCcZ\nLsh0/tpRzbgm/h0th82lO8A6IEDzVLbj6ylrDZwUYIqAavNXZQjhtmR9tp/iTiQH\ngJhd9KY3v7LQ1t9ZUJOG\n=X7XF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T15:30:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/bc7c148ac1c3680d4f3d13b91f265beed87edba1","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKGJjN2MxNDhhYzFjMzY4MGQ0ZjNkMTNiOTFmMjY1YmVlZDg3ZWRiYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/49d16076271dad9b56421d3ff8e702a33f9d5f50","sha":"49d16076271dad9b56421d3ff8e702a33f9d5f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/49d16076271dad9b56421d3ff8e702a33f9d5f50"}],"sha":"bc7c148ac1c3680d4f3d13b91f265beed87edba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/bc7c148ac1c3680d4f3d13b91f265beed87edba1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/49d16076271dad9b56421d3ff8e702a33f9d5f50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:29:23Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:29:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Filter `query` tasks and packages by tags (#14344)\n\n### Description\n\nThird slice of the generic tags work, based on\nhttps://github.com/vercel/turborepo/pull/14343. Review against the\nmetadata branch; CLI selectors are independent.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[Affected tasks] --> F[Apply package and task predicates]\n  F --> D[Expand required prerequisites]\n```\n\n- Add exact, case-sensitive TAG membership predicates for packages and\ntasks.\n- Match package labels only in package predicates, and task or package\nlabels in task predicates.\n- Add task predicates to package task lists, dependency/dependent lists,\nand withDependencies.\n- Add affectedTasks.taskFilter, intersecting selection filters before\nprerequisite expansion. Required prerequisites need not match.\n- Apply traversal-list filters after expansion, without pruning\ntraversal through non-matching tasks.\n\nThe larger schema snapshot delta belongs to this PR''s new predicate\ntypes and arguments. Metadata exposure is covered by its base PR.","tree":{"sha":"d6722978a3aa083df4338a1f8bc28e7120e9ca79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/d6722978a3aa083df4338a1f8bc28e7120e9ca79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/49d16076271dad9b56421d3ff8e702a33f9d5f50","verification":{"payload":"tree d6722978a3aa083df4338a1f8bc28e7120e9ca79\nparent fba5351c47fe9b1bb1669d554a8535f2f3376a36\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790782163 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790782163 -0600\n\nfeat: Filter `query` tasks and packages by tags (#14344)\n\n### Description\n\nThird slice of the generic tags work, based on\nhttps://github.com/vercel/turborepo/pull/14343. Review against the\nmetadata branch; CLI selectors are independent.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[Affected tasks] --> F[Apply package and task predicates]\n  F --> D[Expand required prerequisites]\n```\n\n- Add exact, case-sensitive TAG membership predicates for packages and\ntasks.\n- Match package labels only in package predicates, and task or package\nlabels in task predicates.\n- Add task predicates to package task lists, dependency/dependent lists,\nand withDependencies.\n- Add affectedTasks.taskFilter, intersecting selection filters before\nprerequisite expansion. Required prerequisites need not match.\n- Apply traversal-list filters after expansion, without pruning\ntraversal through non-matching tasks.\n\nThe larger schema snapshot delta belongs to this PR''s new predicate\ntypes and arguments. Metadata exposure is covered by its base PR.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvSrTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdsUQAD6haPaUYrG+TkP+Iewe9BMB\n+2Yeox+F7NKeS0zMBosvkCYTxZAaxT467ugBRXQ0I95MJS653UTEYvWyN/XAC0S0\nP6gs73MgyMT6XTKapxXINvu3jB74Ccs/21vdfUFegQFe8T1Be+fJ0NjYNHqMNLnw\nrJUr6z2XhDZTnHQGDV3UbeCq/yxG0jVqUMKzN/Ub8Z5YiTq0ya+Vsxd85kNslfzg\njAjwGPzy3Bu4WGKsc9OsezeGOVs3KXsbQsNjzxryDa7KOhYuB9PAve/4rOe/zN5j\nX/mYM7kuG2UA0j+yUXVu0mKYQYoX/t9yz5NH6BQj7C1oR8Hu2xMM/PS2yIS88far\naB1IB7RcoRnCPrXKzBC8oPSKzm6tDfutKrO/3oZ/5EXYvIoLqxlIDlTevX0V7jBu\n7/h1l8AfHkk4Y6w5Ha56NtI3EqF3IcC5JX/s/pj3PgYCrD9kfV5oFfL+e2EK6rkO\n7q58gKvdvcAIYUz4BgrqTHAKkDQXY+tpm799kPDMgLXVl4HrjR5wTi2iyTK4GNW6\nc2r1t3DqnGeK2FSUmHdJXKL2RtcQp4pWgqFInZndFtV3wIQPbIxW3DzQlcwb4nFg\nQCTo4wnWQXR5TvbMqDOOeDgZb2A1CiQwnMIaBsyOtDrkiGP4+X3b/HKemfMEP3qt\nkhMhGOQtYrL2RKoEJy2q\n=S/O9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T15:29:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/foll