.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/e2ce8832a152a7b82c22ae15bdc21b3afc3fd2a6","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKGUyY2U4ODMyYTE1MmE3YjgyYzIyYWUxNWJkYzIxYjNhZmMzZmQyYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/143f102e7e9c9982515265072fecedd7f6a69f15","sha":"143f102e7e9c9982515265072fecedd7f6a69f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/143f102e7e9c9982515265072fecedd7f6a69f15"}],"sha":"e2ce8832a152a7b82c22ae15bdc21b3afc3fd2a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/e2ce8832a152a7b82c22ae15bdc21b3afc3fd2a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/143f102e7e9c9982515265072fecedd7f6a69f15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:14:13Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:14:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: Deflake OpenTelemetry and PTY shutdown tests (#14331)\n\n## Why\n\nIn [the Windows CI run for\n#14330](https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/actions/runs/36368544281/job/108759773285),\n`test_otel_cli_flags_do_not_break_run` waited on an absent OpenTelemetry\ncollector until the 20-minute job timeout. In [the macOS run for this\nPR](https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/actions/runs/36371357065/job/108768418272),\nthe PTY shutdown fixture''s root exited before its acknowledgment timer\ncould write the expected `root-exited` marker.\n\n## What changed\n\n```text\nOTel env / CLI flags\n  → run build with metrics emission disabled (no collector needed)\n  → assert success and cache hit\nPTY shutdown fixture\n  → child exits before worker-ack poll\n  → let the pending poll record the wrapper''s exit marker\nNextest\n  → stop either OTel integration test after 60 seconds; do not retry\n  → use defaults for all other tests\n```\n\nThe OpenTelemetry tests still exercise enabled configuration and CLI\nflags, with a 1-second export timeout as a safeguard. Cache priming now\nasserts success rather than silently ignoring a failed run. Removed the\nold Windows spawn-retry, package-install, watch, and cycle overrides, as\nwell as the custom failure-output setting.","tree":{"sha":"0f9a40ce21175c369a59b834dcb63cf4f7411fce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/0f9a40ce21175c369a59b834dcb63cf4f7411fce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/143f102e7e9c9982515265072fecedd7f6a69f15","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f9a40ce21175c369a59b834dcb63cf4f7411fce\nparent 2de14a96ca6fb767f1edb3e6adebc2bd1b8220b3\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790565253 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790565253 -0600\n\ntest: Deflake OpenTelemetry and PTY shutdown tests (#14331)\n\n## Why\n\nIn [the Windows CI run for\n#14330](https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/actions/runs/36368544281/job/108759773285),\n`test_otel_cli_flags_do_not_break_run` waited on an absent OpenTelemetry\ncollector until the 20-minute job timeout. In [the macOS run for this\nPR](https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/actions/runs/36371357065/job/108768418272),\nthe PTY shutdown fixture''s root exited before its acknowledgment timer\ncould write the expected `root-exited` marker.\n\n## What changed\n\n```text\nOTel env / CLI flags\n  → run build with metrics emission disabled (no collector needed)\n  → assert success and cache hit\nPTY shutdown fixture\n  → child exits before worker-ack poll\n  → let the pending poll record the wrapper''s exit marker\nNextest\n  → stop either OTel integration test after 60 seconds; do not retry\n  → use defaults for all other tests\n```\n\nThe OpenTelemetry tests still exercise enabled configuration and CLI\nflags, with a 1-second export timeout as a safeguard. Cache priming now\nasserts success rather than silently ignoring a failed run. Removed the\nold Windows spawn-retry, package-install, watch, and cycle overrides, as\nwell as the custom failure-output setting.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquduFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyB0QAHuJjpAHJD/vqr9Ev2pewDY7\nIIzQGuf+gF+b3rfwBMHAaw8p/Pd7RiTH2QXND6K8+2H+o+sziRGutAJnC5Rwbnf/\nnO3/to4y/CXWrlPRP21r13CSmxOOFgHaI/Y0gWpehMG4XkQ1CkbUv0DqHNuKG4Tm\n3XeK/CBBCMk4KrH1dLeDwZ+NOxDJ3XcZ2NlTEVYyJmjr1E0tLg/944jNWZkM2hVk\nnjFyBziQQSQCaix1Yjjv+TCT6ZkLWtTNF204/CYMxzSSv46DUkzhHqw456YXOvPa\nqIZpXWyjWk1dzdFuzbD/ukC4aIYQ+swgEt9t8NlqBPzfI3gu7mlajOo1ZuxSNxmx\nncK8scZyyCPsXz6mUFjv8Jv9KmZaFJNIwOa1I/86VU3wwnRHxAg6DmMMwkwldtpA\noaCwD+0iW89ylKpefpO+J7VESFNzT3UmRnuOynIgCskaE9tTOb1Cm6bOummuIhis\nXztSSGV48anVcNlkZkVdYivGogkV1hdpGaUD84shVU3/ISzSd3v5mPAORTjZWy4H\nd+xvTR7UAZLponaxCkE0wpDjodgd2KOKr8Wsw9cyZYDOvuHdzDBPsHuIkYjIYxnU\nK5wSsb+lDTNxpNJBaxFLVuwOkQHqMihwE2a3+PN0YBozvG1FPCof9bSPCf8kChhc\nzt5W/qMHf2kOEvzKfxuP\n=8XU3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T03:14:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/eve