https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/2de14a96ca6fb767f1edb3e6adebc2bd1b8220b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:47:44Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:47:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Upgrade standalone turbo on installer reruns (#14330)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Replace a regular binary at the standalone installer destination after\nverifying the release archive, without changing binaries found elsewhere\non PATH.\n- Report `Upgraded turbo <version> at <path>` on reruns and `Installed\nturbo <version> at <path>` on fresh installs.\n- Preserve the existing binary if verification fails, and reject\nsymlinks at the destination.\n- Show the existing PATH location and a platform-specific rerun command\nwhen another installation blocks the standalone installer, without\nguessing how to remove a package-manager-owned binary.\n\n```text\nrerun installer\n  binary at selected destination → verify archive → replace → \"Upgraded turbo ...\"\n  binary elsewhere on PATH      → show path + uninstall guidance + rerun command\n  symlink at destination         → refuse to overwrite\n```\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel[bot] <35613825+vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Vercel <vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"23fa81ee489a3cc6bb609fb2c9dad73d374490ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/23fa81ee489a3cc6bb609fb2c9dad73d374490ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/2de14a96ca6fb767f1edb3e6adebc2bd1b8220b3","verification":{"payload":"tree 23fa81ee489a3cc6bb609fb2c9dad73d374490ec\nparent b8304d126a1c686b6cd5472f4c5df8d04e06df22\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790563664 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790563664 -0600\n\nfix: Upgrade standalone turbo on installer reruns (#14330)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Replace a regular binary at the standalone installer destination after\nverifying the release archive, without changing binaries found elsewhere\non PATH.\n- Report `Upgraded turbo <version> at <path>` on reruns and `Installed\nturbo <version> at <path>` on fresh installs.\n- Preserve the existing binary if verification fails, and reject\nsymlinks at the destination.\n- Show the existing PATH location and a platform-specific rerun command\nwhen another installation blocks the standalone installer, without\nguessing how to remove a package-manager-owned binary.\n\n```text\nrerun installer\n  binary at selected destination → verify archive → replace → \"Upgraded turbo ...\"\n  binary elsewhere on PATH      → show path + uninstall guidance + rerun command\n  symlink at destination         → refuse to overwrite\n```\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel[bot] <35613825+vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Vercel <vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqudVQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASO4QADN2kqwAjvHX82i/mpAdNoy6\nXK6PBpAaCjAy8EIIZs4uvKslvyGiNZfob1tJJ0ivHsTDbwh9x2SKHbh5aqqy0ELp\nbI3KuhrzK9mVnXs8TKhSL9sgcZVL5le510KagrZEEN0YXdZz6HH3YctWx9UstlIv\nKdWQZ7xJUX+b4yb5h+q91CEINlpKDASPNY0XZs+UFGYIlYujpoOEgb1do/thn2fl\n/6xhxkqMfZ0kdWsujvNPE5cIXdHzrNZyRbkMGjiUWaZvmWKlI3mIeG9FQZK+imi4\nRov8cIZ+pyGXyUUC0ZZQOeQera1SkZuRqm4u8Mj1Vd3FILUCgkkl5IbetB09nFlB\nbznj/g4CZYKerU4wVhX7gX0Bj5VjNWDeO5SHw4iI9JsVvTJTexviN9bRS2Eq+B/Q\nhk3W8Q0rwbk5spKtuFpwDjDiFRgN30Wi+DnQ2n+FQFbIU0oP48bbcTVUUfZs8DWH\npnAaRi7BK/525lkcYGEcJGphiN6gZxUqtI/3h/3ktVjBe1f