shed package manifests and `version.txt`, all set to\n`2.11.5-canary.5`.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"62735f84a9a9c99a194167ecdae9700374235fee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/62735f84a9a9c99a194167ecdae9700374235fee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/a50ee6536eac2f7f3168cc38087ee7d8397fc0e9","verification":{"payload":"tree 62735f84a9a9c99a194167ecdae9700374235fee\nparent c9602f339008964f8dfaf6329491c374cf2f0a60\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790554524 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790554524 -0600\n\nchore: Release Turborepo 2.11.5-canary.5 (#14328)\n\n### Description\n\nRecovers the release metadata commit for Turborepo `2.11.5-canary.5`\nafter standalone asset publication failed before the normal release PR\ncould be created.\n\n```text\nnpm package + Git tag + GitHub prerelease\n  already published as 2.11.5-canary.5\n\nmain/version.txt\n  2.11.5-canary.4\n  → 2.11.5-canary.5\n```\n\nThe standalone archives and checksum manifest were recovered from the\noriginal workflow artifact, verified, attached to the existing draft,\nand published before opening this PR. This PR only brings `main` package\nmetadata in sync with that completed release so the next prerelease can\nadvance to `2.11.5-canary.6`.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nConfirm that the diff contains only the release version updates across\nthe nine published package manifests and `version.txt`, all set to\n`2.11.5-canary.5`.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqubGcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAR/sQAF1szsVFngZvANAM367IyVLN\nVv6l8QIcR60c6KeqDGfn0dz198pZDtj4eJ1qwgEyjRI+mGW0NNdoI41bbsruL+zN\nzwz3JlaaDc0sOeNMYICRBo23btQ9WokMsoiPmEQtfuq/xW/pN9iAT1a0QPy3Uv/L\nJOujjbI5KKsMixc6ww1LdtoJ4Qx7s3UG79eogKJYkPmEYc+bFVn1JdIz