68cc38087ee7d8397fc0e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/a50ee6536eac2f7f3168cc38087ee7d8397fc0e9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/c9602f339008964f8dfaf6329491c374cf2f0a60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:58:53Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:58:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Pass repository to release asset commands (#14327)\n\n### Description\n\nPasses the repository explicitly to every `gh release` command in the\nstandalone asset publication job.\n\n```diff\n publish-standalone-assets (no checkout)\n-  gh release view/upload/edit <tag>\n+  gh release view/upload/edit <tag> --repo \"$REPOSITORY\"\n```\n\nThe job intentionally does not check out the repository. Without\n`--repo`, GitHub CLI tried to infer the repository from a local Git\nworktree and failed with `fatal: not a git repository`. The draft-state\nguard then interpreted the empty result as a published release and\nemitted a misleading replacement error.\n\nThe release lookup now runs as a standalone assignment so lookup\nfailures stop the step with their original error instead of being\nconverted into the published-release guard error.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nFrom a directory that is not a Git repository, verify\nrepository-explicit release lookup:\n\n```bash\ntmp=$(mktemp -d)\ncd \"$tmp\"\ngh release view v2.11.5-canary.5 \\\n  --repo vercel/turborepo \\\n  --json isDraft \\\n  --jq .isDraft\n```\n\nThe command should print `true` without attempting to inspect a local\nGit repository.\n\nThis PR intentionally does not recover or publish the existing\n`v2.11.5-canary.5` draft release.","tree":{"sha":"77a2f5245175287efcc8a94d72f62b13451bb1dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/77a2f5245175287efcc8a94d72f62b13451bb1dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/c9602f339008964f8dfaf6329491c374cf2f0a60","verification":{"payload":"tree 77a2f5245175287efcc8a94d72f62b13451bb1dc\nparent 8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790553533 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790553533 -0600\n\nfix: Pass repository to release asset commands (#14327)\n\n### Description\n\nPasses the repository explicitly to every `gh release` command in the\nstandalone asset publication job.\n\n```diff\n publish-standalone-assets (no checkout)\n-  gh release view/upload/edit <tag>\n+  gh release view/upload/edit <tag> --repo \"$REPOSITORY\"\n```\n\nThe job intentionally does not check out the repository. Without\n`--repo`, GitHub CLI tried to infer the repository from a local Git\nworktree and failed with `fatal: not a git repository`. The draft-state\nguard then interpreted the empty result as a published release and\nemitted a misleading replacement error.\n\nThe release lookup now runs as a standalone assignment so lookup\nfailures stop the step with their original error instead of being\nconverted into the published-release guard error.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nFrom a directory that is not a Git repository, verify\nrepository-explicit release lookup:\n\n```bash\ntmp=$(mktemp -d)\ncd \"$tmp\"\ngh release view v2.11.5-canary.5 \\\n  --repo vercel/turborepo \\\n  --json isDraft \\\n  --jq .isDraft\n```\n\nThe command should print `true` without attempting to inspect a local\nGit repository.\n\nThis PR intentionally does not recover or publish the existing\n`v2.11.5-canary.5` draft release.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqua29CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgkAQAACGgANivmDVSfHE9hWCWqG3\nwWxiXAGNg/uyZUN7DODdMliNV/x2uli1hI1MqHn6+ev/3EJy9ZHD1H59H7jxOd5z\n91QawFUKA+3+bGcjOMe0aNXfwLEe1P5jx5Acu+aq+qNtqFTQ6y8shHJoxbULuxgA\nYyz5M8+CsjHMuDfLUo1X/iogj+6P2H2LZOuGr4lDV7NZsTDXkQ1JwMNIG1iA8dNT\n7cSSm96/IkqBbt6xb1up9s+TfyPsi0168LjH+BiDLpYrwXogBbXePCPX3hkTLEQR\n1u0MPCM92kbt4x2C16JEdi/Uwavrdu/n/8TFkRWkDnyG2xoAlwf8gNtMepVPH7uu\nSOVCXHNzmunn1dOKLVF3aVj+mef9edyuWDkTRy5PCSkGjOY334NYmRBPg8tBjTCS\n7BS7BoU463GqIy5V+383lvJwVqAjnb1KKH6dz5hNrjAPWqPrastStX69EkHxoCp3\n2NQqqJVbgLl1fUtNEvW0oIjDKZIzPq44/fGeMdww3beVeqUYeIMzHW8G4Pbh9Orr\n8xk8TDd3CzDdH6bMvSFLoqA2TMLO7emt/Fx5i3VEDAEffjFAy2d5s2DeWrXf+LyM\nmPGop4B4PY0xaLFNkXr/n7wo2sW2oRjf5eSeQcOdeWFWiJqqdw//2xxqQsan/Z7B\n9EoMQwtGOComvb1X81g8\n=JSTv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T23:58:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/c9602f339008964f8dfaf6329491c374cf2f0a60","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKGM5NjAyZjMzOTAwODk2NGY4ZGZhZjYzMjk0OTFjMzc0Y2YyZjBhNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f","sha":"8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f"}],"sha":"c9602f339008964f8dfaf6329491c374cf2f0a60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/c9602f339008964f8dfaf6329491c374cf2f0a60"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:02:03Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:02:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Isolate installer test environment (#14326)\n\n### Description\n\nIsolates GitHub Actions-specific PATH variables in the POSIX installer\ntest harness.\n\n```diff\n createHarness\n   inherit process.env\n+  clear GITHUB_PATH\n+  reset TURBO_NO_MODIFY_PATH\n   set fixture-specific environment\n```\n\nWithout this isolation, the release runner''s real `GITHUB_PATH` made the\ninstaller correctly skip shell-profile changes while the test still\nexpected `.zprofile`. The test could also append its temporary fixture\ndirectory to the runner''s actual Actions PATH file.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nRun the installer tests while simulating inherited GitHub Actions\nvariables:\n\n```bash\ngithub_path_fixture=$(mktemp)\nGITHUB_PATH=\"$github_path_fixture\" TURBO_NO_MODIFY_PATH=1 \\\n  node --test scripts/install.test.mjs\nwc -c \"$github_path_fixture\"\nrm \"$github_path_fixture\"\n```\n\nAll tests should pass, and the fixture should remain at zero bytes.\n\nAfter this merges, start a new release workflow run. Rerunning only the\nfailed job would reuse the existing staging branch, which does not\ncontain this fix.","tree":{"sha":"363db048092bd3abe0fa3c7556ea532b7ebbe7ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/363db048092bd3abe0fa3c7556ea532b7ebbe7ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f","verification":{"payload":"tree 363db048092bd3abe0fa3c7556ea532b7ebbe7ef\nparent 5108f6c9fda7a7aeb2d2f31c46a44bbe966970c7\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790546523 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790546523 -0600\n\nfix: Isolate installer test environment (#14326)\n\n### Description\n\nIsolates GitHub Actions-specific PATH variables in the POSIX installer\ntest harness.\n\n```diff\n createHarness\n   inherit process.env\n+  clear GITHUB_PATH\n+  reset TURBO_NO_MODIFY_PATH\n   set fixture-specific environment\n```\n\nWithout this isolation, the release runner''s real `GITHUB_PATH` made the\ninstaller correctly skip shell-profile changes while the test still\nexpected `.zprofile`. The test could also append its temporary fixture\ndirectory to the runner''s actual Actions PATH file.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nRun the installer tests while simulating inherited GitHub Actions\nvariables:\n\n```bash\ngithub_path_fixture=$(mktemp)\nGITHUB_PATH=\"$github_path_fixture\" TURBO_NO_MODIFY_PATH=1 \\\n  node --test scripts/install.test.mjs\nwc -c \"$github_path_fixture\"\nrm \"$github_path_fixture\"\n```\n\nAll tests should pass, and the fixture should remain at zero bytes.\n\nAfter this merges, start a new release workflow run. Rerunning only the\nfailed job would reuse the existing staging branch, which does not\ncontain this fix.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquZJbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHB0QAIINsG8OWj8T9QvI+g1F67dH\nkMbFWd8pQmmx+TZqDoNCHQAyq+lsfz8dottq2r4xfEYJl8dK4C/WqFy/7t+kiVJ/\nUcbwCx1IbqghLHWNQDjMXEezNNGHnvtq/5IKhPEuNMFpUrXopxTuWjgXAn8sUZgT\nhnOThbSlkQzDA9VVl9P9Di2ULDqn/pCRQEK2JiXOKlObNots8oYpk1mmXNMfWIm3\nKYUJ2+5Z7GV4LWMuJr67mEBbVDby1KUOqU+B2OwkkqvVl8lc/s4WFytbhp30wHiD\nvcGAgFYVB3YlmreePkA4iGor34riW4tVTIXX+lVlR6V6t7iWSOXUq75Yf23rCCTR\na6T5x6z1lwSC6eeQxw/hT1ee09/nNhJrLh67SEZqPAGE9CPY0Kn3Jm+igRyOhzsS\n/6JfXov2T1vXT7d8s7+StVMZ0pt+uUNODRLbBZlUzTL1kHIaqJdoeTYYte/YOr3I\ndsVmUb4K7k447IWDf33Eu2BqR6aOAe8Brfr3tFQXO2h3Gz27qJ17amK4WJ82I0uE\nekMUxWVXKjTgpeoASLJmCf82PlVFqRuWW7+sxEwFLH8mZOhhMAp1kgB6yiHTcgxY\nFwn70Zr5dvE+nr9W8g9QHTX5PmsQZH6EkeXkqyyEv0xJBk0r7kGdm/uE0KqZ3nDK\nXaJDl3CrA6ct+axl2h5d\n=Z9gA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T22:02:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f","node_id":"C_kwDOGKvm49oAKDhjYjY3NjY5ZTczY2Y3M2JkZTBhOGE5ZTBhOWE4MjlkZGQzNDk5M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/commit/5108f6c9fda7a7aeb2d2f31c46a44bbe966970c7","sha":"5108f6c9fda7a7aeb2d2f31c46a44bbe966970c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/5108f6c9fda7a7aeb2d2f31c46a44bbe966970c7"}],"sha":"8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/8cb67669e73cf73bde0a8a9e0a9a829ddd34993f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35677084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonyshew","id":35677084,"login":"anthonyshew","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc3MDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/5108f6c9fda7a7aeb2d2f31c46a44bbe966970c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T21:40:19Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T21:40:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add standalone installers URLs for `curl | bash` (#14325)\n\n### Description\n\nAdds the prerequisites for standalone `turbo` installation on macOS,\nLinux, and Windows and serves the installer scripts directly from the\nTurborepo documentation site.\n\n```text\n/install or /install.ps1\n  resolve latest stable GitHub release\n  download the platform archive and SHA256SUMS\n  verify the archive\n  install turbo and configure PATH\n\nrelease workflow\n  create draft GitHub release\n  upload archives and SHA256SUMS\n  publish release\n```\n\nThis also:\n\n- Packages standalone release archives for each supported target.\n- Keeps the GitHub release in draft state until all installer assets are\nattached.\n- Runs POSIX and Windows installer coverage in the release workflow.\n\nUser-facing installation documentation is intentionally deferred until\nthe production endpoints and release assets have been verified.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nUse the Vercel preview URL to verify that both public installer assets\nbypass documentation routing and retain their exact contents:\n\n```bash\nPREVIEW_URL=\"https://<preview-url>\"\n\nvc curl -fsS -D /tmp/install-sh.headers \\\n  -o /tmp/install \\\n  \"$PREVIEW_URL/install\"\n\nvc curl -fsS -D /tmp/install-ps1.headers \\\n  -o /tmp/install.ps1 \\\n  \"$PREVIEW_URL/install.ps1\"\n\ncmp apps/docs/public/install /tmp/install\ncmp apps/docs/public/install.ps1 /tmp/install.ps1\n```\n\nConfirm that both responses are `200 OK` with:\n\n```text\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\nCache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate\n```\n\nDo not execute the preview-hosted installers until a GitHub release\ncontaining the new standalone archives and `SHA256SUMS` has been\npublished.\n\n  Closes TURBO-6189\n  Closes TURBO-6190","tree":{"sha":"0e159c0958bb03f5ecb9e0c8ba620682c66935fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/0e159c0958bb03f5ecb9e0c8ba620682c66935fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/5108f6c9fda7a7aeb2d2f31c46a44bbe966970c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e159c0958bb03f5ecb9e0c8ba620682c66935fc\nparent a46f82a2742ef0f8e1b5f9acebfbe2544c34c528\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790545219 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790545219 -0600\n\nfeat: Add standalone installers URLs for `curl | bash` (#14325)\n\n### Description\n\nAdds the prerequisites for standalone `turbo` installation on macOS,\nLinux, and Windows and serves the installer scripts directly from the\nTurborepo documentation site.\n\n```text\n/install or /install.ps1\n  resolve latest stable GitHub release\n  download the platform archive and SHA256SUMS\n  verify the archive\n  install turbo and configure PATH\n\nrelease workflow\n  create draft GitHub release\n  upload archives and SHA256SUMS\n  publish release\n```\n\nThis also:\n\n- Packages standalone release archives for each supported target.\n- Keeps the GitHub release in draft state until all installer assets are\nattached.\n- Runs POSIX and Windows installer coverage in the release workflow.\n\nUser-facing installation documentation is intentionally deferred until\nthe production endpoints and release assets have been verified.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nUse the Vercel preview URL to verify that both public installer assets\nbypass documentation routing and retain their exact contents:\n\n```bash\nPREVIEW_URL=\"https://<preview-url>\"\n\nvc curl -fsS -D /tmp/install-sh.headers \\\n  -o /tmp/install \\\n  \"$PREVIEW_URL/install\"\n\nvc curl -fsS -D /tmp/install-ps1.headers \\\n  -o /tmp/install.ps1 \\\n  \"$PREVIEW_URL/install.ps1\"\n\ncmp apps/docs/public/install /tmp/install\ncmp apps/docs/public/install.ps1 /tmp/install.ps1\n```\n\nConfirm that both responses are `200 OK` with:\n\n```text\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\nCache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate\n```\n\nDo not execute the preview-hosted installers until a GitHub release\ncontaining the new standalone archives and `SHA256SUMS` has been\npublished.\n\n  Closes TURBO-6189\n  Closes TURBO-6190","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquY1DCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5CwQABR6z5sAhTWKLJMXDDiHCjs0\nNkFaydm6eN0ixIEJrvcdHgmogkKFpl9QzTy52OhDRLK9iGF1SRHmt2RDHPCAK3vc\ni+a9RhTWeF/c1WFCrbyvt7D5vtGQ489EZSR0h9nTcwlrNjhdm3FB9FMZoLDPj3zy\n2PZkKAz76TCU+WE8Dsy3WxOf2xq4NRGseFx7n82yJV0Vwwim6n2GVxXT7ZJDpmbR\nOmvQwew6xy+byjKeVSXJ3msjBs/9M/iZCh6bsCwX08HU3Ro+l/tl//DJZQusZpOt\nUTCM5F0SllsPCMSu6NaEcuSD+IXyGdMG8/5T5rLQOQ1XbUq+Qj3qOCB2/lRVdqBh\n4bQliz1h40BieqwFtAtMAqH4hnZwAWG9nhxU+ZuCY+x6R8Wwo9peRelmk8rj0n3e\n4GJMb1E83v39kyKqkPZZO37Ts9HE3tjuCvenexeohLlgbDqup0YW6Kh5cDoW4uv9\nDXLyYot47uhI5rl+lY5/yVuzrVzQpuWsrOW2rZts3gbnB73YX/lZawWXtoHideOg\nhpezusWdyncUi6HxOu7Y2GPOEXOO/vFzweE20/qjF1uglCtKuA7L6+XcsvcO3YJR\nlXVS0oJHiOjyyuoIFA2ZR7Kg4xfMycK2TTm18Y2OE5ugNByAL3YlSDjN1PLHaXdV\nMOvxEm742WwBCk/wIeD+\n=WcE1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T21:40:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","e