ithub.com/users/anthonyshew/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonyshew","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/commits/8427e6e5dd7efc7afdf5a332502551fc8f2eabc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T18:32:20Z","email":"anthony.shew@vercel.com","name":"Anthony Shew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T18:32:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Run standalone archive job on manual releases (#14323)\n\n## Summary\n`workflow_dispatch` skips the schedule-only Check Skip Conditions job.\nWithout an explicit `always()` condition, the archive job was skipped\ndespite successful `stage` and Rust build jobs. This adds that guard\nwhile still requiring both direct dependencies to succeed.\n\n```text\nCheck Skip Conditions (skipped for manual runs)\n        ↓\nstage + build-rust (success)\n        ↓\nstandalone-archives (runs)\n```\n\nObserved in [release run\n#36339584573](https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/actions/runs/36339584573).","tree":{"sha":"9a3af96b9e63975348f79729313d19b721553e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/9a3af96b9e63975348f79729313d19b721553e6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/8427e6e5dd7efc7afdf5a332502551fc8f2eabc8","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a3af96b9e63975348f79729313d19b721553e6a\nparent 7f57aa38406027a30a77d46489ebbdf9dd3ef0e5\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790533940 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790533940 -0600\n\nfix: Run standalone archive job on manual releases (#14323)\n\n## Summary\n`workflow_dispatch` skips the schedule-only Check Skip Conditions job.\nWithout an explicit `always()` condition, the archive job was skipped\ndespite successful `stage` and Rust build jobs. This adds that guard\nwhile still requiring both direct dependencies to succeed.\n\n```text\nCheck Skip Conditions (skipped for manual runs)\n        ↓\nstage + build-rust (success)\n        ↓\nstandalone-archives (runs)\n```\n\nObserved in [release run\n#36339584573](https://github.com/vercel/turborepo/actions/runs/36339584573).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquWE0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADzgQAD0XJsHImvu0zWO7hBdFTvEd\np+XDl2NPBjL2tSZHO5/MYpAMe3Y7OGqnZxjSbMsnaut8F0IgMYQiZc1L17suUMaC\nwbUNe3cOi/hAMZh4k5EjO4gv7SPoxFFFTBomoRjSxk6dYbo5SdxxPqgh7+KRaESF\n+V8Bif62lTUUVPZkfZeItGoisu2j0S3wGYChQZaL9PTdXsa7zkdbRTLPnm4V0mCg\nmgc8s/F2HmKXVHHDyznaNJh/hSg2O9GRneQcgK4TYdtEsJl0FShReDwfD8IIqQnu\nENGYyFD03l9tEF40eQK0WRlt2nah/cCjpR66trD2oaVibYkCTc2R445te8yqqUi2\nAKAPF7+UCByG1owGsJiPG2VY4mcx6UGYwjgNyAm7DoSOLAtzDxUNRLg6Z8+hAK8g\nTXm1xaVyS7wHqLGDXMt73LDZ4/3YqJrh/rEbO/rjyKNUeShCA/pq1Dswo5Jo3E7D\nOYpqyCnlZUyPAjj/CWydTQJbqTqLGZ/zA07owKhGyWUOHi8vOsYLNI1V7OjDV27z\nuf0SnT2CvKg80iXQOtL5ZVWOjamwtzF0Npmi7AqD/ZaRKvvTdEraJevZ6/Jvswq1\n5Vz1uFHzN/R6CslFVMObw93YMxWms1vdU2CSwhq7Aem10MkfxgFvx9fe1ZmlYIur\nJBqRqeORvpA1M5NsVL6H\n=jz/a\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T18:32:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/u