rbo archives (#14322)\n\n## Summary\n- Package the existing native release binaries into versioned,\nplatform-named standalone archives for the five currently built targets.\n- Verify each archive contains exactly one root-level executable.\n- Require archive generation before npm publication while keeping the\nnpm package flow unchanged.\n- Leave checksum publication and GitHub release attachment to their\nfollow-up issues.\n\n```text\nRust build matrix\n  ├── versioned standalone archives → layout check → workflow artifact\n  └── existing raw binaries → existing npm package assembly → npm publish\n```\n\nCloses TURBO-6186","tree":{"sha":"1f4ab7adab1ebb9824fba267083bb87b435488a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/1f4ab7adab1ebb9824fba267083bb87b435488a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/7f57aa38406027a30a77d46489ebbdf9dd3ef0e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f4ab7adab1ebb9824fba267083bb87b435488a2\nparent d6b852c53c8473ec88081e826b357feb35938e5e\nauthor Anthony Shew <anthony.shew@vercel.com> 1790532544 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790532544 -0600\n\nfeat: Publish versioned standalone turbo archives (#14322)\n\n## Summary\n- Package the existing native release binaries into versioned,\nplatform-named standalone archives for the five currently built targets.\n- Verify each archive contains exactly one root-level executable.\n- Require archive generation before npm publication while keeping the\nnpm package flow unchanged.\n- Leave checksum publication and GitHub release attachment to their\nfollow-up issues.\n\n```text\nRust build matrix\n  ├── versioned standalone archives → layout check → workflow artifact\n  └── existing raw binaries → existing npm package assembly → npm publish\n```\n\nCloses TURBO-6186","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquVvACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALsgQAJP7W0KfdhwceroaQlmCfKO8\nXZJ76H2bu2ir9F41Yp+Ud5LlxXSyFYMAiBt7nxFLcuZTGMYcjdaJ+