nged at 2.5.7.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nVerify that `https://v2-11-4.turborepo.dev/schema.json` resolves\ncorrectly and provides JSON Schema validation for `turbo.json`.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Shew <anthonyshew@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ec677937ed4106490455d9e244c19e1e5689253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/trees/5ec677937ed4106490455d9e244c19e1e5689253"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/turborepo/git/commits/d6b852c53c8473ec88081e826b357feb35938e5e","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ec677937ed4106490455d9e244c19e1e5689253\nparent c76ac66c4447bfe35301bee0a002d3c60e163342\nauthor Yousef Dawood <78578298+yousefdawood7@users.noreply.github.com> 1790531530 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790531530 -0600\n\ndocs: Update Turborepo schema URL example (#14321)\n\nUpdated the schema URL example to use the latest Turborepo version,\n`v2-11-4`, so the in-editor validation link works correctly.\n\n### Description\n\nUpdated the versioned JSON Schema URL in the editor integration\ndocumentation from `v2-5-7` to `v2-11-4`.\n\nThe feature introduction version remains unchanged at 2.5.7.\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\nVerify that `https://v2-11-4.turborepo.dev/schema.json` resolves\ncorrectly and provides JSON Schema validation for `turbo.json`.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Shew <anthonyshew@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquVfKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKfIQABAn3qCznrPWFvIQqg5CzJ0V\n+BxPCXfM2+Kwr6n8ZIXUh7wZVUuJ+YQiyuYaNcfRBlBZPgDgLDXoq/XG7R297NzP\nE7FxKp9lVAT5P5DIrkfAfWw7dQ/z3gF7JLLc5G17pQVliG+zlVu2wlQAeXdd7U2Q\noVM8Lnf+IOFKoHqMmWCpNrXkUdFoZPl5FukqH86zRrZTbsaEhRjcW/lVTtRS4HaF\nD+pgeQVzsLJvAzDBcvFgqxLNTVj18NRCPHVMRLX+iAj9rOmbPz4Q5+kwH0PHPoMS\nhykwyyzhf+dFGDad+J0oGF8ZZwNP7AYBXOtMg53tjazm7Xcf2zClypKFAPUHCgw7\nZs5Q3OrGiUCG7jWkFOOvByI8aTEd+kbhcpOtHLvq0VDQAZL8jZ7tVTSivNYLHI7f\nIPXbHsfZMdNIhelCHazKYAFOLcmeRGekvCm7NsFa06AItNJEJFbOEZ1pNy1pYyDy\nsQXgh+t2WknVJHh