e edits (#2206)\n\n* Add component tests\n\n* Add createSeriesDateIndex function and corresponding tests\n\n* Add time series table rendering benchmarks\n\n* Refactor TableCell and TimeSeriesTable to improve flag color handling and add tests for flag color resolver\n\n* Enhance TableCellEdit and TimeSeriesTable components for improved input handling and pagination support; add unit tests for new functionality\n\n* Fix corner of scrollbars\n\n* Enhance TimeSeriesTable to support selected date functionality; update benchmarks and add tests for row selection behavior\n\n* Add benchmark test for table-data performance with 50,000 rows\n\n* Implement pagination support in TimeSeriesTable and related components; add new data handling functions and update tests\n\n* Add benchmarks for incremental and full rebuild page loads in TableCellEdit tests\n\n* Refactor table data update logic in TimeSeriesTable to improve performance and maintainability\n\n* Add status bar\n\n* Enhance status bar in TimeSeriesTable to display editing instructions and update tests accordingly\n\n* Enhance TableCellEdit component with accessibility labels and improve keyboard focus visibility; update tests accordingly\n\n* Enhance TableCellEdit and TimeSeriesTable components with improved focus management, data attributes for editing, and updated tests for row selection and field cycling\n\n* Refactor TimeSeriesTable and createSeriesDateIndex for improved date handling; enhance tests for field cycling and editing behavior\n\n* Enhance keyboard navigation in TableCellEdit for improved editing experience; allow Enter key to cycle through fields and advance to the next row\n\n* Enhance keyboard navigation in TimeSeriesTable; add Shift+Arrow functionality for row selection and improve focus management in TableCellEdit tests\n\n* Enhance keyboard hints in TimeSeriesTable; update hints for field navigation and selection adjustments\n\n* Simplefy code\n\n* Enhance keyboard navigation in TimeSeriesTable; add Esc key to deselect rows and Ctrl/Cmd+Enter to save column edits\n\n* Enhance selected date visibility in TimeSeriesTable; add floating button for quick access and improve responsiveness to header height changes\n\n* Enhance keyboard hints in TimeSeriesTable; update save modifier display for platform compatibility\n\n* Enhance save functionality in TimeSeriesTable; update save button state and keyboard hints based on editable fields\n\n* Enhance Load More functionality in TimeSeriesTable; add allowLoadMore prop and update tests for boundary behavior\n\n* Replace labels by aria label on input fields\n\n* Disable row insertion if multiple rows are selected\n\n* Refactor useTimeSeries function to use a separate useTimeSeriesData function; enhance request handling and response structure in tests\n\n* Linter\n\n* Enhance pagination logic in usePaginatedTimeSeries to manage loading states and boundaries for before/after requests\n\n* Remove non functional test\n\n* Add test to reset pagination and discard pending updates on input changes in usePaginatedTimeSeries\n\n* Column in edit mode should not take additoinal space","tree":{"sha":"40a297d805bd3d8eba8e9149464cffed5fb17d0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/git/trees/40a297d805bd3d8eba8e9149464cffed5fb17d0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/git/commits/32eb6b413b67a182723efc135bb7dd230f9dafde","verification":{"payload":"tree 40a297d805bd3d8eba8e9149464cffed5fb17d0c\nparent 415c9131145cd4190bc63a8fa33fe889d648c123\nauthor Werner Kramer <werner.kramer@deltares.nl> 1791375493 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791375493 +0200\n\nImprove rendering performance of table edits (#2206)\n\n* Add component tests\n\n* Add createSeriesDateIndex function and corresponding tests\n\n* Add time series table rendering benchmarks\n\n* Refactor TableCell and TimeSeriesTable to improve flag color handling and add tests for flag color resolver\n\n* Enhance TableCellEdit and TimeSe