ilities to use RefreshCoordinator for polling management\n\n* feat: refactor useTaskRuns and useTasksRuns for improved refresh management and consistency\n\n* fix: correct import statement for useTasksRuns in NonCurrentDataPanel.vue\n\n* refactor: remove polling interval from useWmsLayerCapabilities policies\n\n* fix: remove trailing slash from FEWS base URL in syncFromBackend method\n\n* fix: change error type from Error to TypeError for invalid ISO8601 timestamp\n\n* refactor: determine mode is running or static\n\n* refactor: replace SystemTimeMode with SystemTimeBasis and SystemTimeUpdatePattern\n\n* refactor: update labels and icons for system time display\n\n* Remove immediate for interval in TaskRunProgress\n\n* Use pi provider for system time\n\n* Formatting\n\n* Remove useFocusAwareInterval\n\n* Convert systemTime store to a setup store\n\n* Move authority class and system time fetch to their own files\n\n* Fix wrong usage of useRefreshCoordinator and function type\n\n* Move selectedInterval watch to store\n\n* Add focus and blur to vue slider mark steps for keyboard accessibility\n\n* Remove timeBasis, updatePattern and updateIntervalMs from system time\nmodel and store\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Werner Kramer <werner.kramer@deltares.nl>","tree":{"sha":"a38ced1de41438c4d5abb7bb9372156aaec6153e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/git/trees/a38ced1de41438c4d5abb7bb9372156aaec6153e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/git/commits/d67dce0fbfea5234fd3bf54defa6462311b60af8","verification":{"payload":"tree a38ced1de41438c4d5abb7bb9372156aaec6153e\nparent 2c739641d805a02ae8bee695a912847ea7e5d601\nauthor hvangeffen <144685504+hvangeffen@users.noreply.github.com> 1790328968 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790328968 +0200\n\nAdd support for system time (#2111)\n\n* feat: implement system time management with synchronization and UI integration\n\n* feat: replace Date.now() with systemTimeAuthority.now() for consistent time management\n\n* feat: refactor to use RefreshCoordinator for interval management across services\n\n* feat: refactor to use RefreshCoordinator for interval management in useTopologyThresholds\n\n* feat: refactor WMS layer capabilities to use RefreshCoordinator for polling management\n\n* feat: refactor useTaskRuns and useTasksRuns for improved refresh management and consistency\n\n* fix: correct import statement for useTasksRuns in NonCurrentDataPanel.vue\n\n* refactor: remove polling interval from useWmsLayerCapabilities policies\n\n* fix: remove trailing slash from FEWS base URL in syncFromBackend method\n\n* fix: change error type from Error to TypeError for invalid ISO8601 timestamp\n\n* refactor: determine mode is running or static\n\n* refactor: replace SystemTimeMode with SystemTimeBasis and SystemTimeUpdatePattern\n\n* refactor: update labels and icons for system time display\n\n* Remove immediate for interval in TaskRunProgress\n\n* Use pi provider for system time\n\n* Formatting\n\n* Remove useFocusAwareInterval\n\n* Convert systemTime store to a setup store\n\n* Move authority class and system time fetch to their own files\n\n* Fix wrong usage of useRefreshCoordinator and function type\n\n* Move selectedInterval watch to store\n\n* Add focus and blur to vue slider mark steps for keyboard accessibility\n\n* Remove timeBasis, updatePattern and updateIntervalMs from system time\nmodel and store\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Werner Kramer <werner.kramer@deltares.nl>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtkCICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWjQQAIvGYd/ntKn7W8dVPFOfw27U\nfF+tiOWTWp1sP+5M11eV7nANoGM/67xzr0ly9r/YIc5iQtZT1Rknpmt6fHyzWkkP\nG2BQ4DmjzVjeHuLSDHZaLBMDEWsZp1mufnmKKDehwtT66tmK/I6P4G8z4Up3q4Dw\n5brHmtQHgmSQ9KGNSH5kjGBwP+cQxU46HOieJJeGApFANu4jVIBeoms3pZrpobCN\nt5rYUrjUkCnm1oRYWNjFvEGqIxJXCgYRPfuF/Y2NbV+GvIE1IqvjFshJXNnqkmBP\nSoqW4txP2SlYBZXlDV9Ql7JyWoW83/sdh6x4gaIKqpOL87CLcXBksux9J647rZNv\nYhuWeDBVXdu5OSnt7tHjjY