:"wkramer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjY4MDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkramer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkramer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkramer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkramer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkramer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkramer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/commits/abdcb2ac8551fdf38a9159e31cae24a554a42a55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:24:36Z","email":"werner.kramer@deltares.nl","name":"Werner Kramer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:24:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add module federation (#1458)\n\n* Add plugin display support and module federation setup\n\n- Add `plugin-display` to topology component types, icons, titles, and routes\n- Add `nodeHasPlugin` utility and integrate into display tab logic\n- Add plugin display route and view to router\n- Update navigation logic in TopologyDisplayView for plugin display\n- Add @module-federation/vite and configure federation in Vite config\n- Update Vue dependencies to 3.5.16\n- Update .gitignore for module federation temp files\n\n* Fix environment variable references in Vite configuration for server and security headers\n\n* Refactor navigation handling in PluginDisplayView to emit event\n\n* Workarround for component selection from path param\n\n* Enhance plugin display routing and parameters handling for custom components\n\n* Remove unnecessary toolbar from PluginDisplayView template\n\n* Add filter prop to SpatialTimeSeriesDisplay and enhance filter handling\n\n* Implement useFilterTimeSeries hook and integrate time series in PluginDisplayView\n\n* Update Vite configuration to use new environment variables for proxy and CSP headers\n\n* Rename to VITE_FEWS_WEBOC_MF_MANIFEST\n\n* Workaround for retriggering timeseries prop\n\n* Remove unused selectedTime parameter from useFilterTimeSeries function\n\n* Fix filterId assignment to handle empty filterIds array\n\n* Rename remote key\n\n* Runtime loading of remotes\n\n* Update module federation dependencies\n\n* Load remote components directly\n\n* Rename weboc_mdba_plugins to mdba-micro-frontend\n\n* Remove unused function\n\n* Remove duplicate case\n\n* Remove unused expor and function\n\n* Add plugin-display to dashboard, empty component for now\n\n* Use federation name ''weboc-micro-frontend''\n\n* Use ''micro-frontend'' terminology instead of ''plugin''\n\n* Linter\n\n* Remove unnecessary await\n\n* Refactor remote manifest loading to use manifest JSON for Module Federation initialization\n\n* Feat: add module federation plugin for dynamic loading of remote components\n\n* Refactor MicroFrontendDisplay and TopologyDisplayView to remove customComponent prop and adjust routing\n\n* Refactor module federation integration: simplify plugin usage and restore plugin functionality\n\n* Refactor module federation plugin: streamline manifest loading and improve error handling\n\n* feat: implement module federation composable for remote component loading\n\n* fix: increase micro-frontend-display priority in component type definitions\n\n* feat: update module federation configuration to use ''delft-fews-weboc'' and remove old settings\n\n* fix: update script-src directive to use DEV_CSP_SCRIPT_SRC\n\n* feat: include baseUrl in module federation plugin configuration\n\n* fix: rename variable for module federation manifest URL for clarity\n\n* Add localhost urls as allowed for CSP\n\n* Add manifest json to e2e env file\n\n* Fix and cleanup MF ts errors\n\n* Change MF to not pass timeseries but headers function and\nFewsWebServices url\n\n* Formatting\n\n* fix: remove unused useFilterTimeSeries\n\n* chore: update dependencies\n\n* Add error when micro frontends are not configured correctly\n\n* Remove hard coded times\n\n* Pass hostSettings, component settings and selectedDate to micro frontend\n\n* Use vuetify classes\n\n* Revert to DEV_SERVER_PROXY_FEWS_PI\n\n* Remove VITE_FEWS_WEBOC_MF_MANIFEST_URL from e2e env\n\n* Use vite condig without federation for component test\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: hvangeffen <hunter.vangeffen@vortech.nl>\nCo-authored-by: Werner Kramer <werner.kramer@vortech.nl>","tree":{"sha":"3aa4e3340534e073ec5451a432f9b1e2f4eb5a29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/git/trees/3aa4e3340534e073ec5451a432f9b1e2f4eb5a29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/git/commits/abdcb2ac8551fdf38a9159e31cae24a554a42a55","verification":{"payload":"tree 3aa4e3340534e073ec5451a432f9b1e2f4eb5a29\nparent 04e33563cd98a4e227e8bc5d942dab76cd9ab043\nauthor Werner Kramer <werner.kramer@deltares.nl> 1790069076 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790069076 +0200\n\nAdd module federation (#1458)\n\n* Add plugin display support and module federation setup\n\n- Add `plugin-display` to topology component types, icons, titles, and routes\n- Add `nodeHasPlugin` utility and integrate into display tab logic\n- Add plugin display route and view to router\n- Update navigation logic in TopologyDisplayView for plugin display\n- Add @module-federation/vite and configure federation in Vite config\n- Update Vue dependencies to 3.5.16\n- Update .gitignore for module federation temp files\n\n* Fix environment variable references in Vite configuration for server and security headers\n\n* Refactor navigation handling in PluginDisplayView to emit event\n\n* Workarround for component selection from path param\n\n* Enhance plugin display routing and parameters handling for custom components\n\n* Remove unnecessary toolbar from PluginDisplayView template\n\n* Add filter prop to SpatialTimeSeriesDisplay and enhance filter handling\n\n* Implement useFilterTimeSeries hook and integrate time series in PluginDisplayView\n\n* Update Vite configuration to use new environment variables for proxy and CSP headers\n\n* Rename to VITE_FEWS_WEBOC_MF_MANIFEST\n\n* Workaround for retriggering timeseries prop\n\n* Remove unused selectedTime parameter from useFilterTimeSeries function\n\n* Fix filterId assignment to handle empty filterIds array\n\n* Rename remote key\n\n* Runtime loading of remotes\n\n* Update module federation dependencies\n\n* Load remote components directly\n\n* Rename weboc_mdba_plugins to mdba-micro-frontend\n\n* Remove unused function\n\n* Remove duplicate case\n\n* Remove unused expor and function\n\n* Add plugin-display to dashboard, empty component for now\n\n* Use federation name ''weboc-micro-frontend''\n\n* Use ''micro-frontend'' terminology instead of ''plugin''\n\n* Linter\n\n* Remove unnecessary await\n\n* Refactor remote manifest loading to use manifest JSON for Module Federation initialization\n\n* Feat: add module federation plugin for dynamic loading of remote components\n\n* Refactor MicroFrontendDisplay and TopologyDisplayView to remove customComponent prop and adjust routing\n\n* Refactor module federation integration: simplify plugin usage and restore plugin functionality\n\n* Refactor module federation plugin: streamline manifest loading and improve error handling\n\n* feat: implement module federation composable for remote component loading\n\n* fix: increase micro-frontend-display priority in component type definitions\n\n* feat: update module federation configuration to use ''delft-fews-weboc'' and remove old settings\n\n* fix: update script-src directive to use DEV_CSP_SCRIPT_SRC\n\n* feat: include baseUrl in module federation plugin configuration\n\n* fix: rename variable for module federation manifest URL for clarity\n\n* Add localhost urls as allowed for CSP\n\n* Add manifest json to e2e env file\n\n* Fix and cleanup MF ts errors\n\n* Change MF to not pass timeseries but headers function and\nFewsWebServices url\n\n* Formatting\n\n* fix: remove unused useFilterTimeSeries\n\n* chore: update dependencies\n\n* Add error when micro frontends are not configured correctly\n\n* Remove hard coded times\n\n* Pass hostSettings, component settings and selectedDate to micro frontend\n\n* Use vuetify classes\n\n* Revert to DEV_SERVER_PROXY_FEWS_PI\n\n* Remove VITE_FEWS_WEBOC_MF_MANIFEST_URL from e2e env\n\n* Use vite condig without federation for component test\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: hvangeffen <hunter.vangeffen@vortech.nl>\nCo-authored-by: Werner Kramer <werner.kramer@vortech.nl>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsklUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASEoQAFRGpsD/zuc6j3Mo1DXSkCYO\n8rKk6r4+Md0AVZAV6durxdOk35L5WjN9jvzZC8sD8Ct+GXSyMNxz4ZMjJLLqJgTs\nHvJdpT8Y97PLnodY2c+Pb5bk/8Tln57xS6wCjE318HQHeNx0RI9ZCQp/qkoW8eu4\nWqrBj7RZl6V1/9QtfQre+2Cwb/n97xNgSNQor8+6fgC1Mr/0xfCQ2unlRbLbCTEr\nlG9ysHG9sMWl0JNj+bZzfK/opB2umvTQ1aX2dfwIkjJj7u9PEjQZi6iuCQuATAPd\n4fJtp2JGLZu19v1PIK9Si1t8J7odlEpcoP28Oyet3iZvNn6G0XjfT9//oxAyvTtS\ntNYE3ls1NoJakjW8aYwq8er16QrJD3Cl8su5YPFSTWSsPyf3ZQZimHprYt8/j5CR\nElXu4PBvipCej8o4tp6LzwDH3S689YTlRrzp/LdJ3MWL/C0IlAFgkesJ6CecacKv\n1I3VDJv4h4JC/oj+yXVYpqYfykPVk4Dl+lDNmtoMlwq2mPPVa7CIJ8rwxQe42VFd\nhbOUaoBsotUln4FSYDh7Rsx960hxl3DPqadau5uf5O5QD6wXDc2l6TjqbgzcwmfM\nmeVD0gia+F2sBN/ZwB5IQpNtNF4RaaLs+JcCeL9t/cBo6sY40b2ATPqmqZeRNUOR\nGmCvJjgWj+c0lHu/IQRy\n=46hZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T09:24:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/w