/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceesvoesenek/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceesvoesenek/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceesvoesenek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceesvoesenek/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ceesvoesenek","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/commits/d8ce3bcefd38ca36ecd93f4554ac5608702eb250/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T05:48:51Z","email":"cees.voesenek@vortech.nl","name":"Cees Voesenek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T05:48:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add permissions toggle control (#2110)\n\n* Add control for disabling permissions\n\n* Move permissions to settings, properly reload on permission change\n\n* Move permissions to user login component\n\n* Refactor permission UI to use checkboxes instead of switches for better user experience\n\n* Add a permissions reset button\n\n* Revert unnecessary changes\n\n* Clean up function\n\n* Move excluded permissions control to separate component\n\n* Move excluded permissions to Pinia store\n\n* Move permissions key from layout to app\n\nThis ensures that the entire app is refreshed for new excluded\npermissions, even if another layout than the default is used.\n\n* Move permissions control from login menu to about page\n\n* Disable permissions control if the server does not allow it\n\nDepending on the server configuration, requests with the permission\nexcludes header may be rejected.\n\n* Use permission name if available\n\n* Pass permission excludes header for all FEWS Web Services requests\n\n* Remove dead code\n\n* Hide permissions control if user has no assigned permissions\n\n* Fix app bar colour changing upon setting permission excludes\n\n* Use options object for clarity\n\n* Revert now unnecessary changes to the login component\n\nThis reverts changes from 88bf7c as we have moved the component to the\nAbout page later in this PR.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jules Fleuren <jules.fleuren@vortech.nl>\nCo-authored-by: cees-wolfs-vt <cees.wolfs@vortech.nl>\nCo-authored-by: Werner Kramer <werner.kramer@deltares.nl>","tree":{"sha":"d36fdcdbb443a0e31da8ad48c431ce7a67dca71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/git/trees/d36fdcdbb443a0e31da8ad48c431ce7a67dca71d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Deltares/fews-web-oc/git/commits/d8ce3bcefd38ca36ecd93f4554ac5608702eb250","verification":{"payload":"tree d36fdcdbb443a0e31da8ad48c431ce7a67dca71d\nparent e506af2ccff5570fc72266b74c8814ba4ea66c27\nauthor Cees Voesenek <cees.voesenek@vortech.nl> 1790056131 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790056131 +0200\n\nAdd permissions toggle control (#2110)\n\n* Add control for disabling permissions\n\n* Move permissions to settings, properly reload on permission change\n\n* Move permissions to user login component\n\n* Refactor permission UI to use checkboxes instead of switches for better user experience\n\n* Add a permissions reset button\n\n* Revert unnecessary changes\n\n* Clean up function\n\n* Move excluded permissions control to separate component\n\n* Move excluded permissions to Pinia store\n\n* Move permissions key from layout to app\n\nThis ensures that the entire app is refreshed for new excluded\npermissions, even if another layout than the default is used.\n\n* Move permissions control from login menu to about page\n\n* Disable permissions control if the server does not allow it\n\nDepending on the server configuration, requests with the permission\nexcludes header may be rejected.\n\n* Use permission name if available\n\n* Pass permission excludes header for all FEWS Web Services requests\n\n* Remove dead code\n\n* Hide permissions control if user has no assigned permissions\n\n* Fix app bar colour changing upon setting permission excludes\n\n* Use options object for clarity\n\n* Revert now unnecessary changes to the login component\n\nThis reverts changes from 88bf7c as we have moved the component to the\nAbout page later in this PR.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jules Fleuren <jules.fleuren@vortech.nl>\nCo-authored-by: cees-wolfs-vt <cees.wolfs@vortech.nl>\nCo-authored-by: Werner Kramer <werner.kramer@deltares.nl>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqshbDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAc2wQAEeJwZrTCcRBAzB8SWNF6KZk\nRNIpvik084WBAiZic1ibOg/nDWKE5ckq64JBqYKiCWdh7kcWzIIMvVKlB6LH+ui9\nkFLumxj+fIkxR6azy61ByAXrUaGx8IP1/54TEVLfT3q3QqVQUPNvkUnXDhHP0L3r\nm/rjaiGtQELAr1SdAVxDjreP4r9OlB8/l0XnydJv5Vloc7/alshwHPoROe+5AIu3\nI8zeGC5ywrv1d4gHVxBH4+eWRBsy1jA0MdSNDFvHVY/x42ebLYYnI5XRyKhhG8U0\nKlHYhcQfgQfJuIg5jxmbW+bZsCVRYxwphkyGV76wQDI+2d4SlrCrePDAnw9JA+TI\na0zK8xIaHP6I1D1Fq4mvOtd8ClorRQRUgkQIXJpApOvYUlo7ng3dpySdPxfaCTG7\n9Uv/FNErEcDMRLMLgWMhu/5v1Uj8++N2WHczEWLCeEauzBWWShNjfOGhnMPtZb3B\ni+s+N2zZl0rs2WlwQJdPDntExd+UT8DRxg/goDofBAXq1CMikElx5qnfJcDHZv9J\ng6h3e5FXJOZnLPCNM4IPpyLFTeob7KSasWxtwDddFKrMu5M5P3XbWG7B79JhIUGC\nR1lynZi/SVQw3utnCNOvcl34eA0j/pCcDpVxy0/l+wn2rgidbRj0xjOhFptHQHl7\naV3NGxkP8O1b38fLmY2W\n=sYU6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T05:48:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false